<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">EN_CLT cua_Tiếng⋅Co_ltr Thu Feb 13 2025 16:49:58 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Romans</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thư Rô-ma</para>
  <para style="toc2">Rô-ma</para>
  <para style="toc3">Rom</para>
  <para style="mt">Rô-ma</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Phao-lô, xapok ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, muuyq khơl jah rơơlh jah taayh tawooyh, jah rơơlh đêh ka Hêêl Kaxay ku Kơy Plêêk, <verse eid="ROM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />laa varơuq đơu Kadraq heq tavek xing adroyq hlê khơl kơy hlit ku Kadraq đom Rahlăp Vah, <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />truh Koot Kadraq — Kơy jah pahleh vlôh xing adrơơk ku Đa-vik tyauq ka phon xăk xamơk, <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />Kơy jah đnooy đinq laa Koot Kơy Plêêk bơyh taay yaak hlê varơuq riirh hlê xing aduq kaxêêt tyauq danưng kooy vah xarêh — nưq laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, Lôôk haay, <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />đơu gamưh Kadraq, 'wot heq nhonq xok vanong Plêêk ji chưk khơl jah rơơlh wih truh varơuq tameng tyauq ku xuum tuôq katul dêq hloay khơl tamooy kadrơy vii kơq yal Kadraq, <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />đom sôôq nưq oh ay kung laa khơl adro jah taayh tawooyh thuôk xuq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu. <verse eid="ROM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Atăq truh dêq hloay khơl leq đong măn aduq Rô-ma, laa khơl adro xung xiaq ku Kơy Plêêk, laa khơl vah jah taayh tawooyh: Apôôy vanong plêêk truh dii oh ay kung varơuq hrok hrol xing Kơy Plêêk, Vaq haay, ji xing Lôôk, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Adroyq dik, gamưh Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, gô kuh kway Kơy Plêêk ku gô truh dêq hloay oh ay, vii xuum tuôq ku oh ay jah pahêêr vlôh loch hloay dêh araak. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Vii Kơy Plêêk laa manih xanưk ku gô, Kơy đơu gô hơu varơuq bơơn dêq xuum gô đom Hêêl Kaxay ku Koot Kadraq, nưq laa gô leh padơy e varơuq ahmưk nhăk truh oh ay vlôh đaleq, <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />tuôôy hloay hloay apôôy vôôch đom apok apôôy vôôch ku gô đaneq atoh e hnoq ik, xôq yôôch muut tuôôy neq long tuôôy kadrơy, gô hnoq e đơơt hooy tơơl dal xing iq trôôch ku Kơy Plêêk xôq truh kung oh ay. <verse eid="ROM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Vii gô trôôch kajoq jah tavơh oh ay, xôq ka gô hnoq ik ahlook aklah dii oh ay vanong danưng kooy leq nưq, xôq oh ay jah kajưk kalh, <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />đơu varơuq nưq laa xôq gô kung jah ahmưk nhăk dii oh ay, gamưh varơuq măn đom tôôy adro, nưq laa xuum tuôq ku hloay oh ay ji gô. <verse eid="ROM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />Wơơy oh ay, gô leh trôôch oh ay be lưp xet đaneq 'ngưng yưk gô heq e iq đinq truh kung oh ay (đơu gô heq biq klơl hlê dong truh tuôôy neq), xôq ka gô kung hnoq ik goch weelh raak play leq nưq katul oh ay, kung đaji katul khơl tamooy daak kadrơy. <verse eid="ROM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Gô laa adro pơq lôôk dêq manih Hi Lap hloay adro thiuq xa hok, dêq manih khôôt xet hloay adro vlô apoop. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Lunưq, đôôyq dii gô, dik laa tôq xuum xôq kung đnooy vlôh Hêêl Kaxay ka oh ay, laa khơl manih aduq Rô-ma.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />Vii gô leh kamưưl ier truh Hêêl Kaxay, bơyh nưq laa taay yaak ku Kơy Plêêk xôq varơuq wơơt xok deng ka dêq hloay khơl leq tuôq, nưq laa deng adroyq dik ka manih Jo Thaiq, hloay deng ka manih Hi Lap. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Bơyh varơuq hyioh jăk ku Kơy Plêêk jah kahnoq vlôh đom Hêêl Kaxay nưq, xing xuum tuôq truh xuum tuôq, đaji heq jah valơk đaneq: “Bơh adro hyioh jăk hnoq riirh xing xuum tuôq.”<verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Vii đơơt tôq dayh ku Kơy Plêêk xing plêêk jah kahnoq vlôh tachơơl dii tôôy varơuq leh kuh kul ji leh hyioh jăk ku khơl drơy, laa khơl adro rôp toop varơuq dik đom varơuq leh hyioh jăk, <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />vii varơuq biit xet truh Kơy Plêêk yôôych ro raang măn katul oot, bơyh Kơy Plêêk heq kahnoq varơuq nưq ka oot. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Vii xing tuôôy panưk pajêêk dêh araak, kaluh kajoq leh hloq ik ku Kadraq, nưq laa dêq taay yaak hloay yaak xăk đơơy đơơy ku Kadraq, raay jah nhonq xet ro raang, tuôôy jah hlolh xet gamưh kaluh panưk pajêêk ku Kadraq, xôq ka oot leh e kajoq đnooy tagêh ik. <verse eid="ROM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />Anưq laa vii long nhonq xet Kơy Plêêk, oot heq leh vanê ayuôôt Kadraq laa Kơy Plêêk, kung leh kuh kway Kadraq. Xaloah muut đnư, oot heq vlôh jêêk leh yuôôr đom kaluh xuum biit oot, ji xuum ta'ngơk khưrq ku oot heq biq varơuq kamơng jaluk klum katuh. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Tuôôy kadih xưng laa khôôt kheoq, oot heq ăm hloq kadih oot vlô apoop, <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />ji oot heq tađôôy tađnah tađnaak ku Kơy Plêêk leh hư hlơơp bơơn dang tachưng truh long lơuq ku koot manih hư hlơơp, kung đaji ku paroh xêêp, ôô paroh, ji pi ahnoot.<verse eid="ROM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Lunưq, Kơy Plêêk heq pahnăp ka'lăk oot muut kaluh xuum hmưch ku xuum oot wih truh varơuq leh xarêh xaraat, xôq xăk xamơk oot biq dơơp 'moh nhuk katul bing oot, <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />nưq laa khơl adro heq tađôôy varơuq dik ku Kơy Plêêk bơơn varơuq pa ôôh, ji heq vanê ayuôôt kung hơu varơuq paroh pajêêk thay vii Kơy Panưk Pajêêk, laa Kơy đangq jah kacheeu ayuôôt dong truh đơơy đơơy. Amen.<verse eid="ROM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Bơyh kakơq nưq, Kơy Plêêk heq pahnăp ka'lăk oot ka kaluh hmưch trôôch 'moh nhơy, vii khơl kadrê ku oot heq tađôôy kach xa vik tưq nhiên jêêk kach đêh tưq nhiên, <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />kung anưq, bing khơl kanau kung dang anưq, atêq tuôôy kadih ka'lăk kach xa vik tưq nhiên dii khơl kadrê, yôôch chiuq huur vuh đom xuum hmưch ku oot truh mamuuyq, tuôôy khơl kanau dii khơl kanau dơơp varơuq bơyq ba, yôôch nhonq hlê tol kadih oot xadrah dook, ji varơuq taxưngq dii varơuq bơyq ba ku oot.<verse eid="ROM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Kung tyauq kach đơu oot heq leh 'yo hloq pheq e Kơy Plêêk đom nhonq xet oot laa kaxay liep, yôôych Kơy Plêêk heq pahnăp ka'lăk oot ka xuum biit hư hlơơp, xôq dơơp kaluh varơuq be troq jơq, <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />vii heq biq galôp viik tôôy varơuq leh hyioh jăk, xơk aak, hmưch trôôch, xuum xơk; viik ngăk kaluh varơuq ku varơuq geet 'yarơ, păk kaxêêt, takaay tayaat, aluut pa ôôh, xơk xuum; kaluh apok đnooy ramooy, <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />đnooy pahnhiq, 'yarơ geet Kơy Plêêk, lienq xauq, katơơk galơh, pa ưưt khwoak, 'ngưng varơuq dơơp xơk xơuq, leh tameng tyauq miq vaq, <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />nhonq xet axit, leh jư apok tavek, leh tabông, leh e xuum biit angơuq. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Nưq laa khơl adro long heq nhonq xet xưh xadrah hyioh jăk ku Kơy Plêêk, đaneq kơyq lôp kaluh varơuq đanưq laa xưngq kaxêêt, bơh oot leh vơ lôp kaluh varơuq nưq, đơu oot măn ưng athêêp ka khơl adro leq gưlh lôp.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />Lunưq, nee dro hơq — paq kê kơyq ragơy xưh xadrah — ay leh e kakơq kajoq tagêh hlê ik, vii đom varơuq kajoq đơu ay xưh xadrah adro kadrơy, yôôych ay kadih atok xadrah ay; bơyh ay, laa adro xưh xadrah, kung lôp kaluh varơuq nưq. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Măn haay heq xet đaneq varơuq xưh xadrah ku Kơy Plêêk laa tamuut dii varơuq dik tachơơl hlê khơl adro lôp kaluh varơuq đanưq. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Bơh, nee adro hơq, laa dro xưh xadrah khơl leq lôp kaluh varơuq đanưq đơu kadih xăk kung dơơp kaluh varơuq đanưq, e jơq ay biit truh varơuq neq, đaneq ay hnoq xaloot klơlh varơuq xưh xadrah ku Kơy Plêêk? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Long laa ay 'yo leh ra kajoq varơuq karoh e ku xuum hwêêt ji xuum atuq xuum kung varơuq chiuq uunq ku Kadraq, vii leh xet đaneq xuum hwêêt ku Kơy Plêêk jarooy ay truh varơuq wiit xuum? <verse eid="ROM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Bơh gamưq tyauq varơuq găk khăk ku ay ji xuum klaak leh chiuq wiit xuum, ay đong kadih agoop xôq varơuq tôq dayh ka xăk đom hngơy tôq dayh ji kahnoq vlôh truh varơuq xưh xadrah hyioh jăk ku Kơy Plêêk, <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />laa Kơy hnoq bla ka tôôy dro 'yo tyauq kaluh varơuq dơơp ku adro nưq: <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Muuyq panưh laa varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy deng ka khơl leq axek akhiim tađnah tađnaak ji vanê vado kung jaq triq măn miet tyauq varơuq kajưk xuum ku varơuq kaxay, <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />măn pi hơq laa varơuq tôq dayh kung đơơt jaraq rahưk rahưk deng ka khơl adro bơyh hmưch trôôch kalih ji leh tameng varơuq dik đơu biq aluut pamê tyauq varơuq leh hyioh jăk. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Pơơl dal ji pơơl hwơơl măn tol tôôy phool hiel ku manih dơơp varơuq xơk, ku manih Jo Thaiq adroyq dik, hloay ku manih Hi Lap. <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Bơh tađnah tađnaak ji vanê vado kung varơuq hrok hrol deng ka tôôy dro dơơp varơuq kaxay, ka manih Jo Thaiq adroyq dik, hloay ka manih Hi Lap. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />Vii leh e varơuq bing kơyq đom varơuq rama vlôh ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="ROM 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Long khơl leq heq lôp kadrôôp tyauq kach leh e ganuun, yôôych kung hnoq kaxêêt hlơơp tyauq kach leh e ganuun, ji long khơl leq heq lôp kadrôôp măn katul ganuun, yôôych hnoq biq xưh xadrah bơơn ganuun. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Vii be aalq khơl adro tameng ganuun laa hyioh jăk kangưưr Kơy Plêêk, bơh khơl adro dơơp tyauq ganuun yôôych hnoq ik xưng hyioh jăk. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Vii tuôôy kaluh tamooy daak kadrơy, laa khơl tamooy leh e ganuun, tyauq trôôk tưq nhiên dơơp kaluh varơuq ku ganuun, yôôych long leh e ganuun, oot laa ganuun ka kadih oot, <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />nưq laa khơl adro ăm hloq kaluh varơuq dơơp ku ganuun jah valơk đom xuum oot, tuôôy xuum klaak oot dơơp xanưk, ji kaluh iq biit rôp xadrah long pheq đnooy apok tagêh katul kadih oot dii mamuuyq <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />đom hngơy đơu Kơy Plêêk hnoq xưh xadrah kaluh varơuq padu kadook ku khơl kadrơy gamưh hlê Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, tyauq đaji Hêêl Kaxay ku gô.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Măn atoh ay xok yal laa manih Jo Thaiq, gamưh muut ganuun, pa ưưt akhwoak đom Kơy Plêêk, <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />hlolh xet iq trôôch Kadraq, 'yo kahra kaluh varơuq đêh xateek galơh iaq jah pato dayq xing đom ganuun, <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />katuôôy, ay kadih tuôq kajưk kadih xăk laa manih jarooy trôôk khơl adro apul, xaraar tađnah ka khơl leq măn đom kamơng jaluk, <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />adro pato dayq bing vlô apoop, thơy pato bing adro oh de, vii jah e trôôk daak ku xa hok ji ku varơuq dik đom ganuun, <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />anưq yôôych, nee adro pato dayq adro kadrơy hơq, ay be pato kadih xăk long aleq? Nee adro padoh pato te xa atôk hơq, ay e xa atôk be? <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Nee adro dăt leh ik tuut taak hơq, ay e tuut taak be? Nee adro ramêq kaluh vangưl hơq, ay e atôk đôô kaluh hnhư đơơp be? <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />Ay pa ưưt xăk laa adro măn đom ganuun, ay e đnooy ra ơơh Kơy Plêêk bơơn varơuq gưlh lôp ganuun be? <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Bơyh “yal Kơy Plêêk biq katơơk galơh katul đom kaluh tamooy daak kadrơy vii kơq êêp,” dang đaji apok heq jah valơk. <verse eid="ROM 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Dik, tabơh pheep goch kađuh taway truh e ich atoh ay hnoq ik dưk dơơp ganuun, bơh atoh ay laa adro gưlh lôp ganuun, yôôych varơuq goch kađuh ku ay heq vlôh jêêk be goch kađuh. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Nưq yôôych, atoh muuyq dro koq goch kađuh tameng jư kaluh đooy vôôch ku ganuun, yôôych be aalq varơuq koq goch kađuh ku dro nưq hnoq ik jauq đaji varơuq heq goch kađuh be aalq? <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Ji tuôôy dơơp xaleep ganuun, adro koq goch kađuh aduq xăk xamơk hnoq xưh xadrah ay, 'ngưq adro xing chư valơk ji pheep goch kađuh laa adro vii gưlh lôp ganuun. <verse eid="ROM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Vii be aalq muuyq dro xing kaveeh pi gôk laa manih Jo Thaiq, kung be aalq thưq măn pi gôk tol xăk xamơk laa pheep goch kađuh, <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />tađôôy muut đnư, manih Jo Thaiq laa xăk xamơk măn aduq kinq kadook pi 'lăp, ji pheep goch kađuh laa ku xuum klaak bơyh Kơy Phool Hiel, leh aalq bơơn chư valơk; đơu varơuq xưngq vado ku adro nưq be aalq xing koot manih bơh laa xing Kơy Plêêk.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Nưq yôôych, e thêq ku manih Jo Thaiq ji kajoq? Long lơơy ich ku varơuq goch kađuh laa kajoq? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Thier 'ngưng truh tôôy panưh! Vii adroyq dik, nưq laa oot heq ik pahnăp kaluh apok xanoh ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Xôq dơơp kajoq atoh muuyq sôôq adro leh e xuum tuôq? Dang aleq xuum leh tuôq ku oot hnoq dơơp ka varơuq jư apok ku Kơy Plêêk vlôh jêêk hư hlơơp? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Varơuq nưq leh xalih vlôh ik. Wiit hlê, dayh vanê Kơy Plêêk laa dong dik, măn tôôy dro laa adro pa ôôh lar. Đaji heq jah valơk đaneq: “Xôq long đaleq yôôych Kadraq hnoq hloay heq jah kahnoq vlôh laa hyioh jăk đom kaluh apok xanoh ku Kadraq, ji Kadraq hnoq jah jay tuôôy Kadraq chiuq xadrah xưh.”<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Bơh atoh varơuq leh hyioh jăk ku haay kahnoq vlôh varơuq hyioh jăk ku Kơy Plêêk, yôôych haay hnoq đnooy kajoq? Dang aleq Kơy Plêêk leh hyioh jăk tuôôy apôôt đơơt tôq dayh ku Kadraq? (Gô đong đnooy tyauq kach koot manih.) <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Varơuq nưq leh xalih vlôh ik! Vii atoh đanưq yôôych dơơp aleq Kơy Plêêk hnoq xưh xadrah dêh araak? <verse eid="ROM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Măn atoh varơuq dong dik ku Kơy Plêêk heq dơơp ka tađnah tađnaak Kadraq galơh tok kang iaq aduq varơuq pa ôôh lar ku gô, yôôych taay aleq gô măn đong biq xưh xadrah đaji muuyq dro lôp kadrôôp? <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Ji leh aalq (dang đaji 'wot biq pa hnhiq ji đaji taleq dro hôôk đinq 'wot đnooy đaneq) “Haay duh dơơp varơuq xơk, xôq varơuq kaxay hnoq ik xalih truh” long aleq? — Varơuq xadrah xôq ka oot laa xưngq đangq.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />Nưq yôôch aleq? Haay e tolh iaq be?Dêq hloay leh. Bơyh 'wot heq rôp xadrah dêq manih Jo Thaiq hloay manih Hi Lap yôôch, dêq hloay pheq măn 'laarq kadrôôp maroh. <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />Đaji heq jah valơk đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:10">“Be e kơyq hyioh jăk, pheq đnooy muuyq dro kung leh.<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />Be e kơyq hlolh xet.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:11">Be e kơyq axek akhiim Kơy Plêêk.<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Dêq hloay heq hooy tawek hyaak. Oot kung mamuuyq vlôh jêêk leh yuôôr.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:12">Be e kơyq dơơp varơuq kaxay, pheq đnooy leh e muuyq dro.”<verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />“Ranong hongq oot đaji poop laluk jah luh vlôh.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:13">Dii kapiet oot, oot kưq đnooy vlôh apok pa ôôh aluut.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:13">Nok đôk ku volh tuul măn 'laarq vel oot,”<verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />“huuy oot tađnưk viik apok karoay axaap ji geet 'yarơ.”<verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />“Pla jôôk oot talăng dayh tagay kahrôq vahaap.<verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />Varơuq pahrưp pahrek ji hlu jiq tol kaluh trôôk hooy ku oot.<verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />Ji oot be xet ka trôôk tagu hlê.”<verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />“Be e varơuq kuh yôq Kơy Plêêk kangưưr mot oot.”<verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Panưh kadrơy, haay xet đaneq long kaluh kajoq đơu ganuun pato dayq laa đnooy dii khơl leq măn đom ganuun, xôq ka tưng poop huuy biq hôp hnhep, ji dêq dêh araak chiuq kadrôôp 'laarq varơuq xưh xadrah xing Kơy Plêêk, <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />bơyh vii, kangưưr Kadraq, be koot manih xăk xamơk leq jah xưng hyioh jăk xing kaluh varơuq dơơp tyauq ganuun; vii varơuq nhonq xet kadrôôp maroh laa gamưh ganuun.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Bơh juneq, varơuq hyioh jăk ku Kơy Plêêk heq jah kahnoq vlôh pi gôk ganuun, tuôôy jah dơơp xanưk bơyh ganuun ji khơl kơy hnhư hlit, <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />đơu varơuq hyioh jăk ku Kơy Plêêk yôôych gamưh xuum tuôq aduq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, 'ngưq laa deng ka tôôy dro tuôq, vii be e varơuq 'yo aklah leq. <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />Vii tôôy dro heq lôp kadrôôp ji biq thiuq hlơơp tađnah tađnaak ku Kơy Plêêk, <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />đơu leh duh bla jaq leq tuôôy jah 'yo laa hyioh jăk bơyh vanong plêêk ku Kadraq gamưh hlê varơuq wơơt xok đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Kơy đơu Kơy Plêêk heq đinq adroyq đaji muuyq kuah lêh wơơt kadrôôp gamưh xuum tuôq aduq vahaap Kơy nưq, xôq laa bơơn xanưk truh varơuq hyioh jăk ku Kadraq, vii kơq varơuq ka'lăk hlê kaluh kadrôôp maroh 'miêh heq e adroyq neq <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />bơyh xuum chiuq uunq ku Kơy Plêêk, wih truh varơuq kahnoq vlôh varơuq hyioh jăk ku Kadraq đom tuôôy kawat juneq, xôq ka Kadraq laa hyioh jăk ji xưng hyioh jăk ka kơyq tabôk thơơl xing xuum tuôq aduq Lôôk Jê-xu.<verse eid="ROM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Nưq yôôych, xuum kadih pa ưưt măn aduq leq? Ni heq biq ka'lăk. Bơyh ganuun leq? Ganuun ku varơuq dơơp be? Leh 'leq! Bơh laa bơyh ganuun ku xuum tuôq. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Vii haay xadrah hloq muuyq dro jah xưng hyioh jăk bơyh xuum tuôq, leh bơyh kaluh varơuq dơơp tyauq ganuun. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Long Kơy Plêêk vơ laa ku manih Jo Thaiq đơu heq? Leh aalq kung laa ku tamooy daak kadrơy ih? Jơq, kung laa ku tamooy daak kadrơy, <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />vii dong dik vơ e muuyq Kơy Plêêk, laa Kơy hnoq xưng hyioh jăk manih chiuq goch kađuh bơyh xuum tuôq, hloay manih leh goch kađuh gamưh xuum tuôq nưq. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />Nưq yôôych, haay e dơơp ka ganuun paq ik xung bơơn xuum tuôq nưq be? Varơuq nưq leh xalih vlôh ik. Wiit hlê, haay dơơp kajưk ganuun.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Nưq, haay hnoq đnooy Ap-ra-ham, mo kơy ku haay tyauq ka panưh xăk xamơk, heq 'yo hloq jah kajoq? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Bơyh atoh Ap-ra-ham jah xưng hyioh jăk bơyh varơuq dơơp, yôôych kơy e kơq xôq pa ưưt, bơh leh aalq laa kangưưr Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />Vii Rahlăp Vah đnooy kajoq? “Ap-ra-ham tuôq gamưh Kơy Plêêk, ji varơuq nưq jah 'yo laa hyioh jăk ka kơy.” <verse eid="ROM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Panưh kadrơy, đôôyq dii kơyq dơơp varơuq, yôôych jêêt kông leh ik 'yo đaji vanong, bơh laa đaji lôôkq. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Măn đôôyq dii kơyq leh dơơp varơuq, đơu tuôq aduq Kơy khienq adro e kadrôôp jêêk hyioh jăk, yôôych xuum tuôq ku adro nưq jah 'yo laa hyioh jăk. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />Pheq đnooy đaji Đa-vik kung đnooy truh vanong kaxay ku adro đơu Kơy Plêêk 'yo laa hyioh jăk be bơyh varơuq dơơp:<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />“Vanong ka khơl leq đơu kaluh varơuq xơk aak ni heq jah tha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 4:7">ji kaluh kadrôôp maroh ni heq ik katuh galôp.<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />Vanong ka adro đơu Lôôk kajưk dik heq leh jauq truh kadrôôp maroh ku xăk.”<verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Nưq yôôych, vanong kaxay neq deng ka adro chiuq goch kađuh, long kung deng ka adro leh goch kađuh? Bơyh haay đong đnooy: “Xuum tuôq nưq jah 'yo laa hyioh jăk ka Ap-ra-ham.” <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Nưq, xuum tuôq hơq heq jah 'yo đaji đaleq? Laa đom tuôôy heq goch kađuh long đom tuôôy koq goch kađuh? Leh aalq đom tuôôy heq goch kađuh, bơh laa đom tuôôy koq goch kađuh. <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />Kơy heq nhonq hlêêl goch kađuh đaji dơuq xanưk ku varơuq hyioh jăk xing xuum tuôq, nưq laa xuum tuôq đom tuôôy koq goch kađuh, xôq ka kơy laa mo kơy ku dêq hloay khơl leq e xuum tuôq long koq goch kađuh, jarooy truh varơuq hyioh jăk jah 'yo ka khơl adro nưq; <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />kung xôq ka kơy laa mo kơy ku adro chiuq goch kađuh đôôyq dii khơl leq leh vơ vlôh xing pheep goch kađuh, đơu măn laa khơl adro dơơp tyauq hlêêl jôôk xuum tuôq ku Ap-ra-ham, mo kơy haay, đom tuôôy koq goch kađuh.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />Vii apok tavek deng ka Ap-ra-ham long deng ka koot xau ku kơy, nưq laa xôq ka adro laa adro dưk hlê dêh araak, be aalq gamưh ganuun bơh laa gamưh varơuq hyioh jăk ku xuum tuôq. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Vii atoh khơl adro dưk hlê vlôh xing ganuun, yôôych xuum tuôq biq hlơơp paq ik xung, ji apok tavek biq ka'lăk. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Bơyh ganuun taway hlê đơơt tôq dayh, bơh aduq leq leh e ganuun yôôych kung leh e varơuq lôp kadrôôp. <verse eid="ROM 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Vii kakơq nưq, lunưq khơl adro dưk katôôl laa vlôh xing xuum tuôq, xôq ăm tyauq ka kach ku vanong plêêk, xôq apok tavek laa kajưk dik ka tôôy koot xau — leh ăm adro vơ vlôh xing ganuun đơu heq, bơh laa ka adro kung vlôh xing xuum tuôq ku Ap-ra-ham, đơu kơy laa mo kơy ku dêq hloay haay, <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />đaji heq jah valơk đaneq: “Gô heq lăp koot dơơp vaq ku 'ngưng tamooy daak,” măn kangưưr Kơy đơu kơy tuôq gamưh, 'ngưq laa Kơy Plêêk, Kơy khienq ka adro kaxêêt e varơuq riirh ji taayh kaluh varơuq leh e đaji đong e; <verse eid="ROM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />đơu kơy laa adro heq tuôq gamưh tol xuum takôô gamưh galơh iaq hloay varơuq takôô, xôq ka kơy jah vlôh jêêk vaq ku 'ngưng tamooy daak, tyauq đaji varơuq heq jah xanoh: “Koot xau ku koot hnoq laa đanưq.” <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />Ji long leh hmưq hraap pôôt đom xuum tuôq, kơy heq nhonq hloq xăk xamơk kadih kơy đaji biq kaxêêt yôôch (vii jah kơh muuyq hreek xanưm), kung đom varơuq kateh ha'yauq aduq klaak koot ku Sa-ra. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Bơh wih truh apok tavek ku Kơy Plêêk, kơy heq be biq biit ravơq aklah xuum muut varơuq leh tuôq, wiit hlê, kơy heq jah kalh paraat đom xuum tuôq, tuôôy tơơk tađnah tađnaak tok Kơy Plêêk, <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />ji heq xaleep jah tuôq kajưk đaneq varơuq kajoq Kadraq heq tavek, yôôych Kadraq kung e taay yaak xôq dưk dơơp. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Lunưq “xuum tuôq nưq jah 'yo laa hyioh jăk ka kơy”. <verse eid="ROM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Panưh kadrơy, apok heq jah valơk đaneq “xuum tuôq nưq jah 'yo laa hyioh jăk ka kơy”, be aalq vơ vii kơy, <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />đơu măn vii haay, laa ăm khơl adro đơu xuum tuôq nưq hnoq jah 'yo laa hyioh jăk, 'ngưq laa ka khơl leq tuôq aduq Kơy heq khienq Lôôk Jê-xu, Lôôk haay, riirh hlê xing aduq kaxêêt, <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />đơu Kadraq heq biq nôôp vii varơuq vii lôp ku haay ji heq jah dơơp ăm riirh hlê vii varơuq xưng hyioh jăk ku haay.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Anưq yôôych, vii heq jah xưng hyioh jăk bơyh xuum tuôq, haay hnoq ik jah varơuq tagu dii Kơy Plêêk gamưh Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />đơu hlê Kơy nưq, haay bơyh xuum tuôq kung heq e trôôk muut đom vanong plêêk neq, laa aduq đơu haay dưk kajưk măn taalh, ji haay hlah xuum gamưh tol xuum takôô gamưh truh tađnah tađnaak ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Bơh leh vơ đanưq, đơu haay măn hlah xuum đom 'ngưng pơơl hwơơl, vii xet đaneq pơơl dal taway truh ka paraat chiuq uunq; <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />măn ka paraat chiuq uunq neq yôôych taway truh phâmh châk jah atuq tôôy, măn phâmh châk jah atuq tôôy neq yôôych taway truh varơuq takôô gamưh. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Măn varơuq takôô gamưh nưq be dơơp ăm kamưưl, bơyh kơq xung xiaq ku Kơy Plêêk heq jah kahrôq uk muut xuum haay gamưh Kơy Phool Hiel, Kơy heq jah kahniq ka haay. <verse eid="ROM 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Kung koq dêq, tuôôy haay măn laa khơl adro ravoch, yôôych muut klip tuôôy kawat, Lôôk Wơơt Dêh heq kaxêêt thay ka khơl adro e kadrôôp. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Dik leh klêq e kơyq hnoq chiuq kaxêêt thay ka manih hyioh jăk. Long e hnoq e adro kung hôôk kaxêêt thay ka adro xuum kaxay. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Bơh Kơy Plêêk ăm hloq xung xiaq ku kadih Kadraq đôôyq dii haay, nưq laa tuôôy haay măn laa manih kadrôôp, yôôych Lôôk Wơơt Dêh heq kaxêêt thay ka haay. <verse eid="ROM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Anưq, juneq, tuôôy heq jah xưng hyioh jăk bơyh vahaap Kadraq, yôôych haay hnoq kang jah wơơt klơlh đơơt tôq dayh 'ngưng iaq đnoyq gamưh Kadraq. <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Vii atoh haay, long laa tachơơl, heq jah tagu hlê dii Kơy Plêêk gamưh varơuq kaxêêt ku Koot Kadraq, yôôych tuôôy heq jah tagu hlê yôôch, haay hnoq kang jah wơơt bơyh varơuq riirh ku Kadraq 'ngưng iaq đnoyq. <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Bơh leh vơ anưq, đơu haay măn pa ưưt xăk đom Kơy Plêêk gamưh hlê Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, đơu gamưh Kadraq, juneq haay heq nhonq jah varơuq tagu hlê.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />Vii kakơq nưq, đaji vơ hlê muuyq adro đơu kadrôôp maroh heq muut đom dêh araak, ji hlê kadrôôp maroh varơuq kaxêêt, lunưq varơuq kaxêêt kung lơy taba truh dêq hloay koot manih, vii kơq varơuq nưq đơu tôôy dro heq lôp kadrôôp. <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Vii ăm truh katuôôy ku ganuun, yôôych kadrôôp maroh 'miêh heq e đom dêh araak yôôch, bơh kadrôôp leh ik jauq truh tuôôy koq e ganuun. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Lunư, varơuq kaxêêt heq dưk xanok xing đơơy A-đam ăm truh đơơy Môi-se, pheq đnooy tol khơl adro leh lôp kadrôôp măn dang raa achung dii varơuq lôp kadrôôp ku A-đam, đơu kơy laa long lơuq ku Kơy pheq truh.<verse eid="ROM 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Lunưq, varơuq lôp kadrôôp leh dang vanong kaxay tyauq kach đanưq. Vii atoh bơyh varơuq lôp kadrôôp ku muuyq dro đơu 'ngưng dro heq kaxêêt, yôôych vanong plêêk ku Kơy Plêêk, ji kadrool bơyh vanong plêêk ku muuyq dro, 'ngưq laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, deng ka 'ngưng dro laa raah jôh kang 'ngưng iaq đnoyq! <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Kadrool nưq leh aalq đaji kach gamưh hlê muuyq dro lôp kadrôôp. Vii long varơuq xưh xadrah xing muuyq dro đơu vlôh, jarooy truh varơuq tiel dook, bơh vlôh xing 'ngưng varơuq lôp kadrôôp, vanong kaxay wih truh varơuq xưng hyioh jăk. <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Vii atoh bơyh varơuq lôp kadrôôp ku muuyq dro, đơu varơuq kaxêêt heq dưk xanok gamưh hlê muuyq dro nưq, yôôych khơl adro nhonq jah varơuq raah jôh ku vanong plêêk ji ku kadrool truh varơuq hyioh jăk hnoq kang dưk xanok 'ngưng iaq đnoyq đom varơuq riirh gamưh muuyq dro, 'ngưq laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu. <verse eid="ROM 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Lunưq, đaleq bơyh muuyq lôp kadrôôp wih tôôy dro muut varơuq hmơt dook, yôôych bơyh muuyq varơuq dơơp hyioh jăk kung wih tôôy dro truh varơuq xưng hyioh jăk ku varơuq riirh đanưq. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Vii pheq đnooy đaleq bơyh varơuq leh tameng ku muuyq dro, đơu 'ngưng dro biq jêêk manih kadrôôp, yôôych kung bơyh varơuq tameng tyauq ku muuyq dro đơu 'ngưng dro hnoq jah jêêk hyioh jăk đanưq. <verse eid="ROM 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Panưh kadrơy, ganuun heq xalieh muut xôq varơuq lôp kadrôôp hnoq ik athêêp 'ngưng. Bơh aduq leq kadrôôp maroh athêêp 'ngưng, yôôych vanong plêêk kang raah jôh athêêp, <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />Xôq ka kadrôôp maroh dưk xanok đom varơuq kaxêêt đaji đaleq, yôôych vanong plêêk kung hnoq ik dưk xanok bơyh varơuq hyioh jăk đaji đanưq xôq wih truh varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy, gamưh Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, Lôôk haay.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Nưq yôôych, haay hnoq đnooy đaleq? Haay duh dơơp đnoyq đom kadrôôp maroh xôq vanong plêêk athêêp raah jôh be? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Varơuq nưq leh xalih vlôh ik. Haay laa adro heq kaxêêt đôôyq dii kadrôôp maroh yôôych dơơp aleq haay hnoq măn riirh đom ni? <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Long oh ay leh xet đaneq atoh kơyq heq chiuq bap-tem đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu laa heq jah bap-tem muut đom varơuq kaxêêt ku Kadraq long aleq? <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />Kơq nưq, haay heq ik up dii Kadraq gamưh pheep bap-tem muut đom varơuq kaxêêt, xôq ăm dang đaji Lôôk Wơơt Dêh gamưh tađnah tađnaak ku Vaq heq jah khienq riirh hlê xing aduq kaxêêt đaleq, yôôych haay kung hnoq ik tawaak hooy đom varơuq riirh đơơu đanưq. <verse eid="ROM 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Bơyh atoh haay heq vlôh jêêk anguk muuyq dii kung muuyq dang varơuq kaxêêt ku Kadraq, yôôych panưh kadrơy, haay kung hnoq laa đanưq aduq varơuq riirh hlê ku Kadraq; <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />Bơyh xet varơuq neq, đaneq koot manih duut ku haay heq biq đongq đing dii Kadraq, xôq xăk xamơk ku kadrôôp maroh hnoq ik biq dơyh ka'lăk, be măn khienq haay dơơp xapok ka kadrôôp maroh đnoyq. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Vii kơyq heq kaxêêt yôôych jah 'nhuôôt ka'lăk kaluh rôp xadrah xing kadrôôp maroh. <verse eid="ROM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Bơh atoh haay heq kaxêêt dii Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, yôôych haay tuôq đaneq haay kung hnoq riirh kung dii Kadraq, <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />vii xet đaneq atêq tuôôy jah khienq riirh hlê xing aduq kaxêêt, Lôôk Wơơt Dêh leh măn kaxêêt đnoyq; varơuq kaxêêt leh măn dưk xanưk tol Kadraq. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Vii varơuq kaxêêt đơu Kadraq heq chiuq, nưq laa Kadraq heq kaxêêt đôôyq dii kadrôôp maroh muuyq yưk đu hloay. Măn varơuq riirh đơu Kadraq riirh, nưq laa Kadraq riirh ka Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="ROM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />Kung tyauq kach nưq, tabơh oh ay pheq 'yo kadih xăk laa adro kaxêêt đôôyq dii kadrôôp maroh, bơh laa riirh ka Kơy Plêêk đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu.<verse eid="ROM 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Anưq, te xôq kadrôôp maroh dưk xanok đom xăk xamơk tameng 'laarq varơuq kaxêêt ku oh ay, xôq yôôch tameng tyauq kaluh hmưch trôôch ku ni. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Kung te noop kaluh xăk xamơk ku haay ka kadrôôp maroh đaji valong đôô ku varơuq leh hyioh jăk. Bơh dayh tơơk tưp kadih haay ka Kơy Plêêk, đaji laa đong riirh hlê xing adro kaxêêt, ji kaluh xăk xamơk ku haay đaji valong đôô ku varơuq hyioh jăk ka Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Bơyh kadrôôp maroh hnoq be ik dưk xanok tol oh ay, vii oh ay leh măn 'laarq ganuun, bơh laa 'laarq vanong plêêk.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Anưq yôôych đaleq? Haay e duh lôp kadrôôp vii haay be măn 'laarq ganuun, đơu măn 'laarq vanong plêêk be? Varơuq nưq leh xalih vlôh ik. <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Oh ay leh xet đaneq oh ay noop kadih xăk ka varơuq kajoq đaji xapok đom varơuq tameng tyauq, yôôych oh ay vlôh jêêk xapok ka varơuq đơu xăk tameng tyauq long aleq— paq kê laa ku kadrôôp maroh jarooy truh varơuq kaxêêt, long laa ku varơuq tameng tyauq jarooy truh varơuq hyioh jăk? <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Bơh kuh kway Kơy Plêêk vii oh ay 'miêh laa xapok ku kadrôôp maroh, đơu oh ay heq xing 'lăp xuum klaak tameng tyauq đôôyq dii kaluh apok pato dayq đơu xăk jah pato ăm. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />Măn atêq tuôôy jah luh vlôh vlôh klơlh kadrôôp maroh, oh ay heq jah dơơp xapok ka varơuq hyioh jăk. <verse eid="ROM 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />Gô đnooy tyauq kach koot manih bơyh kơq ka varơuq ravoch ku xăk xamơk oh ay. Vii đaleq oh ay heq noop kaluh xăk xamơk ku haay đaji xapok ka varơuq klơơr 'yêq ji ka varơuq xơk tauq neq truh varơuq xơk tauq hơq, yôôych juneq, kung đanưq, oh ay dayh tơơk tưp kaluh xăk xamơk ku haay đaji xapok ka varơuq hyioh jăk wih truh varơuq yuôôr vah. <verse eid="ROM 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Vii tuôôy oh ay măn laa xapok ku kadrôôp maroh, yôôych oh ay 'miêh jah rayơh rayơơy đôôyq dii varơuq hyioh jăk. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Nưq yôôych oh ay heq e raak play kajoq tuôôy nưq truh kaluh thưq đơu juneq oh ay kadih hloq kamưưl? Vii lôôch dik ku kaluh varơuq nưq laa varơuq kaxêêt. <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Bơh juneq, atêq tuôôy jah luh vlôh vlôh klơlh kadrôôp maroh ji jah dơơp xapok ka Kơy Plêêk, oh ay e raak play ku xăk jarooy truh varơuq yuôôr vah, đơu lôôch dik laa varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Vii jêêt kông ku kadrôôp maroh laa varơuq kaxêêt, bơh vanong kaxay ku Kơy Plêêk laa varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, Lôôk haay.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Wơơy oh ay (vii gô đong đnooy dii khơl adro xet ganuun), long laa oh ay leh xet đaneq ganuun e qwuyen tol muuyq dro đom truh dong leq dro nưq măn riirh long aleq? <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Vii dro khơl kadrê e kanau heq biq ganuun vek jư dii adro kanau măn riirh ku mư, bơh atoh kanau kaxêêt, yôôych mư jah dơyh ka'lăk klơlh ganuun truh adro kanau nưq. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Lunưq, đom tuôôy kanau măn riirh, atoh mư xa vik dii muuyq dro khơl kanau kadrơy, yôôych mư hnoq ăm xet tajinq dii anơng taayh adro tuut taak. Bơh atoh kanau kaxêêt, yôôych mư jah rayơh rayơơy klơlh ganuun, mư leh aalq laa adro tuut taak long xa vik dii dro kanau kadrơy. <verse eid="ROM 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Kung nưq, wơơy oh ay ku gô, kadih oh ay kung heq jah dơơp ăm kaxêêt đôôyq dii ganuun gamưh xăk xamơk ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, xôq ka oh ay jah anguk muuyq dii adro kadrơy, 'ngưq laa dii Kơy heq jah khienq riirh hlê xing aduq kaxêêt, xôq ka haay hnoq raak play ka Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Vii tuôôy haay đong măn đom xăk xamơk, kaluh hmưch trôôch kadrôôp maroh gamưh hlê ganuun 'miêh dưk dơơp đom kaluh xăk xamơk ku haay xôq raak play ka varơuq kaxêêt. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Bơh juneq haay heq jah dơyh ka'lăk klơlh ganuun, vii heq kaxêêt đôôyq dii varơuq đơu haay 'miêh biq vek jư, lunưq haay hnoq ik hơu varơuq đom kach đơơu ku Kơy Phool Hiel đơu leh aalq kach hnu duut ku chư valơk.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />Anưq, haay hnoq đnooy kajoq? Ganuun laa kadrôôp maroh ih? Varơuq nưq leh xalih vlôh ik. Lunư, gô heq be nhonq xet kadrôôp maroh atoh leh gamưh muut ganuun. Vii gô heq be nhonq xet kadrôôp hmưch trôôch atoh ganuun leh đnooy: “Xăk te hmưch trôôch.” <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Bơh kadrôôp maroh, atêq tuôôy rôp xok katuôôy hlê ganeen, heq taway hlê tôôy hmưch trôôch đom gô. Vii leh e ganuun yôôych kadrôôp maroh kaxêêt. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Panưh kadrơy, droyq hơq, gô 'miêh riirh leh e ganuun, bơh atêq tuôôy ganeen truh, yôôych kadrôôp maroh heq riirh hlê, <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />măn gô yôôych kaxêêt. Ji ganeen laa varơuq wih truh varơuq riirh, yôôych ni heq jah hloq đaji laa varơuq kaxêêt đôôyq dii gô. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />Vii atêq tuôôy rôp xok katuôôy gamưh muut ganeen, kadrôôp maroh heq aluut pa ôôh gô, ji gamưh hlê đnư, heq păk kaxêêt gô. <verse eid="ROM 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Đanưq, ganuun laa vah, ganeen kung laa vah, hyioh jăk, ji tamaq kaxay.<verse eid="ROM 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Anưq, varơuq tamaq kaxay heq vlôh jêêk varơuq kaxêêt ka gô long aleq? Varơuq nưq leh xalih vlôh ik. Wih hlê, xôq gamưh hlê varơuq tamaq kaxay, kadrôôp maroh hnoq ik biq kahnoq vlôh laa kadrôôp maroh, 'ngưq laa varơuq taway hlê varơuq kaxêêt đom gô, xôq ăm hlê ganeen, kadrôôp maroh kang vlôh jêêk xơk aak paq ik. <verse eid="ROM 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Vii haay xet đaneq ganuun laa danưng kooy, măn kadih xăk gô laa xăk xamơk, heq biq tek dơơp xapok 'laarq kadrôôp maroh. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />Bơyh gô leh hlolh varơuq gô dơơp vlôh. Vii be aalq gô dưk dơơp varơuq đơu gô trôôch. Bơh gô dưk dơơp varơuq đơu gô 'yarơ. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Bơh atoh gô dơơp varơuq đơu gô leh trôôch, yôôych gô ưng anưq dii ganuun đaneq ganuun laa tolh kaxay. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Bơh juneq kadih gô leh măn dơơp varơuq nưq đnoyq, đơu laa kadrôôp maroh đong măn đom gô! <verse eid="ROM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Vii gô xet đaneq varơuq kaxay be măn đom gô, 'ngưq laa đom xăk xamơk gô. Vii ưng trôôch varơuq kaxay yôôych đong măn e đom gô, bơh dơơp vlôh varơuq kaxay yôôych leh. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Bơyh varơuq kaxay đơu gô trôôch yôôych gô leh dơơp, bơh varơuq xơk đơu gô leh trôôch, yôôych gô dưk dơơp ni. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Măn atoh gô dơơp varơuq đơu gô leh trôôch, yôôych leh aalq kadih gô dơơp varơuq nưq đnoyq, bơh laa kadrôôp maroh măn đom gô. <verse eid="ROM 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Lunưq, gô nhonq vlôh ganuun neq đom gô, 'ngưq laa đom koot manih ưng trôôch dơơp varơuq kaxay neq, nưq laa varơuq xơk đong măn e đom gô. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Vii gô hlah trôôch truh ganuun ku Kơy Plêêk tyauq koot manih pi 'lăp. <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />Bơh gô 'yo hloq muuyq ganuun kadrơy đom kaluh xăk xamơk gô damưq tachơơl hlê ganuun ku xuum biit gô ji rôp băt gô bơơn ganuun ku kadrôôp maroh, laa ganuun đong măn e đom kaluh xăk xamơk ku gô. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Gô laa muuyq dro pơơl ra ơơh! Kơyq hnoq waak wơơt gô klơlh xăk xamơk ku varơuq kaxêêt neq? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />Kuh kway Kơy Plêêk gamưh Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, Lôôk haay! Vii anưq lunưq, tabơh dii xuum biit, kadih gô hơu varơuq ganuun ku Kơy Plêêk, bơh dii xăk xamơk yôôych deng ka ganuun ku kadrôôp maroh.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Lunưq, juneq be e xadrah dook leq dêq ka khơl leq măn đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu. <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />Vii ganuun Kơy Phool Hiel ku varơuq riirh đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu heq luh vlôh gô klơlh ganuun ku kadrôôp maroh ji varơuq kaxêêt. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Bơyh đôôyq dii varơuq leh dơơp ik ku ganuun, 'ngưq laa đom varơuq ni 'miêh ravoch kơq xăk xamơk, yôôych Kơy Plêêk, atêq tuôôy patăk kadih Koot Kadraq truh đom ka varơuq dang đaji xăk xamơk kadrôôp maroh ji vii kơq kadrôôp maroh, Kadraq heq rôp xadrah kadrôôp maroh đom xăk xamơk, <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />xôq kaluh varơuq hyioh jăk ku ganuun jah dơơp xaleep đom haay, laa khơl adro leh tawaak hooy tyauq xăk xamơk bơh tyauq Kơy Phool Hiel. <verse eid="ROM 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Vii khơl adro riirh tyauq xăk xamơk yôôych tabông muut kaluh varơuq thuôk xăk xamơk, măn khơl adro tyauq Kơy Phool Hiel yôôych tabông muut kaluh varơuq thuôk Kơy Phool Hiel. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Bơyh xuum biit ku xăk xamơk laa varơuq kaxêêt, măn xuum biit ku Kơy Phool Hiel laa varơuq riirh ji hrok hrol; <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />nưq laa vii xuum biit ku xăk xamơk yôôych tachơơl hlê dii Kơy Plêêk, bơyh ni leh chiuq tameng 'laarq ganuun ku Kơy Plêêk, jo ni leh e paraat xôq dơơp anưq. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Măn khơl adro riirh tyauq xăk xamơk yôôych be hnoq ik dơơp hlah xuum Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="ROM 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Lunưq, oh ay leh măn đom xăk xamơk, đơu laa đom Kơy Phool Hiel, atoh Kơy Phool Hiel ku Kơy Plêêk dong dik măn đom oh ay. Măn atoh kơyq leh e Kơy Phool Hiel ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, yôôych adro nưq leh thuôk xuq Kadraq. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Wih hlê atoh Lôôk Wơơt Dêh măn đom oh ay, yôôych long xăk xamơk laa varơuq kaxêêt vii kơq kadrôôp maroh, bơh Kơy Phool Hiel laa varơuq riirh vii kơq varơuq hyioh jăk. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Măn atoh Kơy Phool Hiel ku Kơy heq khienq Lôôk Jê-xu riirh hlê xing aduq kaxêêt đong măn đom oh ay, yôôych Kơy heq khienq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu riirh hlê xing aduq kaxêêt kung hnoq kahniq varơuq riirh ka xăk xamơk tameng 'laarq varơuq kaxêêt ku oh ay, hlê Kơy Phool Hiel Kadraq măn đom oh ay.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Lunưq, wơơy oh ay, haay leh aalq laa adro pơq lôôkq xăk xamơk xôq riirh tyauq xăk xamơk. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />Vii atoh oh ay riirh tyauq xăk xamơk, oh ay hnoq pheq kaxêêt, măn atoh gamưh Kơy Phool Hiel, oh ay dơơp kaxêêt kaluh varơuq dơơp ku xăk xamơk, yôôych oh ay hnoq riirh. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Vii long kơyq jah jarooy bơyh Kơy Phool Hiel ku Kơy Plêêk, khơl adro nưq laa koot ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />Vii oh ay heq leh nhonq xok danưng kooy ku ka varơuq dơơp xapok xôq hlê wih truh varơuq yôq varaal, bơh oh ay heq nhonq xok Kơy Phool Hiel ku varơuq dơơp koot văch, gamưh đnư haay taayh atok: “A-ba, Vaq!” <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Jơq Kơy Phool Hiel dơơp xanưk kung dii danưng kooy haay đaneq haay laa koot xau Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Đơu atoh laa koot xau, yôôych kung laa adro dưk katôôl: muuyq panưh laa khơl adro dưk katôôl ku Kơy Plêêk, panưh kadrơy laa khơl adro kung dưk katôôl dii Lôôk Wơơt Dêh — atoh haay dong dik chiuq pơơl dii Kadraq xôq haay kung jah tađnah tađnaak dii Kadraq.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Vii gô biit đaneq kaluh pơơl jiq măn katuôôy juneq be taxưngq taso dii tađnah tađnaak jeq jah kahnoq vlôh ka haay. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Bơyh varơuq dong dik takôô kôô ku tôôy paroh đong pơl wol takôô kôô varơuq kahnoq vlôh ku koot xau Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />Vii tôôy paroh heq biq rôp tyauq 'laarq ka varơuq hư hlơơp, be aalq ưng iq, bơh laa vii Kơy heq khienq oot pheq tameng tyauq, ganưq muut varơuq takôô gamưh <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />đaneq kadih tôôy paroh kung hnoq jah wơơt klơlh vlôh klơlh xăk xamơk dơơp xapok ku varơuq hư hlơơp xôq muut varơuq rayơh rayơơy đom tađnah tađnaak ku koot xau Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="ROM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Vii haay xet đaneq padêq hloay tôôy paroh kung tanguh alo ji axe axek đom jiq jiêh dong truh hngơy neng. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Lunư, leh vơ laa anưq, đơu haay kung anưq, long e jah play adroyq dik ku Kơy Phool Hiel — kadih haay kung tanguh alo đom xăk, đong tuôôy pơl wol takôô kôô jah dơơp koot văch, 'ngưq laa varơuq wơơt bla xăk xamơk ku haay. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Vii haay heq jah wơơt đom xuum takôô gamưh kajưk dik. Đơu takôô gamưh atoh jah 'yo hloq yôôych leh aalq laa takôô gamưh. Vii e kơyq takôô gamưh truh varơuq đơu ni hloq ik? <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Măn atoh haay takôô gamưh truh varơuq haay koq hloq, yôôych haay đong pơl wol takôô kôô bơơn varơuq wêêt xuum.<verse eid="ROM 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Bơh tyauq kach dang anưq, Kơy Phool Hiel kung waak đom varơuq ravoch ku haay. Vii haay leh xet varơuq đơu haay duh apôôy đaji haay đangq pheq dơơp, bơh jơq Kơy Phool Hiel talăng jăk apôôy thaay dii kaluh apok ramôôl alo leh hnoq đnooy vlôh bơơn apok. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Măn Kơy 'yo hloq xuum manih yôôych xet xuum biit ku Kơy Phool Hiel laa đaleq, vii Kadraq apôôy thaay tamuut iq trôôch Kơy Plêêk ka khơl jah rơơlh. <verse eid="ROM 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Panưh kadrơy, haay xet đaneq Kơy Plêêk dưk dơơp tôôy varơuq kung dii mamuuyq xôq wih truh varơuq tolh kaxay deng ka khơl adro xung xiaq Kơy Plêêk, 'ngưq laa ka khơl adro e jah varơuq taayh tawooyh tyauq iq đinq ku Kadraq. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Vii khơl adro đơu Kadraq heq xet adroyq, yôôych Kadraq kung heq đinq 'miêh xôq dang đaji long lơuq ku Koot Kadraq, xôq ka Koot nưq vlôh jêêk koot ay katul 'ngưng oh ay. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Panưh kadrơy, khơl leq đơu Kadraq heq đinq 'miêh, yôôych khơl adro nưq Kadraq kung heq taayh. Ji khơl kơyq đơu Kadraq heq taayh, yôôych khơl dro nưq Kadraq kung heq xưng hyioh jăk. Măn khơl leq đơu Kadraq heq xưng hyioh jăk, yôôych khơl dro nưq Kadraq kung heq dơơp ăm tađnah tađnaak.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Nưq yôôych, haay hnoq đnooy aleq truh kaluh varơuq neq? Atoh Kơy Plêêk thay mot ka haay, yôôych kơyq tachơơl hlê haay? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Kadraq dong dik laa Kơy heq leh alay kadih Koot kadraq, bơh heq pahnăp Koot nưq xaloah thêq dêq hloay haay, yôôych kơq kajoq đơu Kadraq hnoq be kahniq ăm tôôy varơuq kung dii Koot nưq ka haay? <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Kơyq hnoq rôp kadrôôp tachơơl hlê khơl adro jah rơơlh ku Kơy Plêêk? Kơy Plêêk laa Kơy xưng hyioh jăk. <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Kơyq laa adro rôp xadrah? Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu laa Kơy heq kaxêêt — bơh iaq nưq đnoyq, atêq tuôôy jah khienq riirh hlê, Kơy nưq pheq đnooy măn pi ti akoh ku Kơy Plêêk — ji Kadraq đong apôôy thaay ka haay. <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Kơyq hnoq aklah đêh haay vlôh klơlh xung xiaq ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh? Jơq be pơơl dal, pơơl hwơơl, rôôp toop, pangoot thaal, xăk lalôk, ngwi hiêmh, long xieh mak? <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Đaji apok jah valơk, đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:36">“Vii kơq Kadraq, 'wot koot chiuq xadrah kaxêêt tuôôt hngơy.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:36">'Wot koot biq 'yo đaji trưưu deng ka varơuq pưk vloot.”<verse eid="ROM 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Lunư, đom tôôy varơuq nưq, haay jah jay padêq hloay gamưh Kơy xung xiaq haay. <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Vii gô jah tuôq kajưk đaneq be e varơuq kaxêêt, long varơuq riirh, be e khơl yaak plêêk, long khơl dưk xanok, long kaluh varơuq juneq, long kaluh varơuq hnoq truh, be e qwuyen lưk, <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />long pi yơơt, long pi jaruq, kung be e paq kê tôôy paroh leq đêh, hnoq e paraat aklah vlôh haay vlôh klơlh xung xiaq ku Kơy Plêêk, laa varơuq măn đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, Lôôk haay.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Gô đnooy varơuq dik đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh. Gô leh đnooy pa ôôh — xuum klaak gô dơơp xanưk ka gô đom Lôôk Phool Hiel, <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />đaneq đôôyq dii gô, e varơuq hlu rơu kôt ji ajơ jiq jiêh leh hlơơp đom xuum gô. <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />Bơyh gô 'miêh trôôch kajoq kadih gô biq karoay axaap, aklah vlôh klơlh Lôôk Wơơt Dêh vii kơq oh ay gô, laa khơl adro takuul takiel ku gô tyauq phon xăk; <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />kadih oot laa tamooy I-sơ-ra-ên, đơu kaluh varơuq thuôk xuq oot laa jah dơơp koot văch, tađnah tađnaak, kaluh tavek, varơuq kahniq ăm ganuun, varơuq ayuôôt laat, ji kaluh apok tavek; <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />oot vlôh xing kaluh khơl mo kơy, ji Lôôk Wơơt Dêh vlôh xing oot — (nưq laa tyauq phon xăk) — Kadraq laa Kơy galơh iaq hloay dêq hloay, 'ngưq laa Kơy Plêêk đangq jah vanê ayuôôt dong truh đơơy đơơy. Amen.<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Bơh leh e varơuq apok ku Kơy Plêêk heq hlơơp paq ik xung. Vii be aalq dêq hloay khơl leq vlôh xing I-sơ-ra-ên, yôôych nưq laa manih I-sơ-ra-ên. <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />Kung be aalq dêq hloay koot xau laa adrơơk ku Ap-ra-ham. Bơh laa, “Bơyh I-sak, adrơơk ku koot hnoq jah taayh anơng.” <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Iq ji koot xau tyauq xăk xamơk, khơl adro nưq leh aalq laa khơl koot ku Kơy Plêêk. Wih hlê, koot xau ku apok tavek yôôych jah 'yo đaji adrơơk. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Vii neq laa apok tavek: “Muut tuôôy kawat neq, Gô hnoq truh, ji hnoq e muuyq koot kanau deng ka Sa-ra.” <verse eid="ROM 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Bơh leh vơ đanưq, đơu Rê-bê-ka kung anưq tuôôy e bonq bơyh muuyq dro, laa I-sak, mo kơy ku haay — <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11" />vii đom tuôôy koot koq jah pa iir vlôh, kung koq dơơp varơuq kaxay long varơuq xơk leq, xôq ka iq đinq ku Kơy Plêêk tyauq varơuq rơơlh xok ku Kadraq hnoq ik jư kajưk, <verse eid="ROM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12" />Leh aalq bơyh varơuq dơơp, bơh laa bơyh Kơy taayh tawooyh — varơuq heq jah ăm mo jah xet, nưq laa: “Adro kôt hnoq dơơp xapok ka dro de,” <verse eid="ROM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />I đaji varơuq heq jah valơk: “Gô xiaq Ja-kôp, bơh Gô 'yarơ Ê-sau.”<verse eid="ROM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />Anưq, haay hnoq đnooy đaleq? Dang aleq e varơuq leh hyioh jăk aduq Kơy Plêêk ih? Varơuq nưq leh xalih vlôh ik. <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />Vii Kadraq xanoh dii Môi-se, đaneq: “Gô hnoq kahnoq xuum hwêêt dii paq kê kơyq đơu Gô trôôch kahnoq xuum hwêêt, ji Gô hnoq biit angơuq paq kê kơyq đơu Gô trôôch biit angơuq.” <verse eid="ROM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Lunưq be aalq bơyh adro leq ưng trôôch, kung leh aalq kơq adro leq charơơk đnen charơơk kahơ, bơh laa jo thuôk Kơy Plêêk, Kơy kahnoq xuum biit angơuq. <verse eid="ROM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Vii Rahlăp Vah đnooy truh Pha-ra-ôn đaneq: “Vii jơq iq đinq neq Gô heq panưk xăk tok, xôq gamưh xăk Gô hnoq ik ăm hloq da uh qwuyen ku Gô, ji xôq aleq ka yal Gô hnoq ik jah padoh pahêêr loch tol vari.” <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Lunưq, Kadraq kahnoq xuum hwêêt đôôyq dii adro leq Kadraq trôôch, bơh Kadraq dơơp găk xuum adro leq Kadraq trôôch.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Anưq yôôych oh ay hnoq đnooy dii gô: “Anưq, aleq Kadraq măn trek kưq? Vii kơyq tachơơl hlê iq đinq ku Kadraq ik?” <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Nee dro hơq, tol dong dik yôôych ay laa kơyq đơu aklơ ka'lăk Kơy Plêêk? Dang aleq vâk kajoq jah vlêêt vlôh hnoq đnooy dii adro heq vlêêt vlôh ni: “Aleq kơy heq dơơp vlôh gô tyauq đaji luneq” ư? <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Long laa manih thơq gôômq be e qwuyen tol vari dik, xôq dơơp vlôh muuyq vlong đôô xing kung muuyq đum vari, tyauq apoop neq deng ka varơuq kôt lơyq, bơh thư hơq deng ka varơuq lêq iaq? <verse eid="ROM 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Măn atoh Kơy Plêêk, vii xung ăm hloq đơơt tôq dayh ku Kadraq ji kahnoq vlôh taay yaak ku Kadraq, heq chiuq uunq đom varơuq atuq xuum thier kôt đôôyq dii kaluh valong đôô deng ka đơơt tôq dayh, heq jah ralauq 'miêh ka varơuq kaxêêt hlơơp dêq; <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />ji xôq Kadraq hnoq ik kahnoq vlôh varơuq karoh e ku tađnah tađnaak Kadraq tol kaluh valong đôô deng ka varơuq biit angơuq đơu Kadraq heq ralauq 'miêh ka varơuq tađnah tađnaak — <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />hloay ka haay laa khơl adro đơu Kadraq heq taayh tawooyh, leh vơ xing manih Jo Thaiq, đơu măn xing kaluh tamooy daak kadrơy, yôôych aleq? <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Đaji Kadraq kung xanoh đom rahlăp Ô-sê, đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">“Gô hnoq taayh adro leh aalq tamooy Gô, laa ‘tamooy Gô’,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">ji adro be jah xiaq laa ‘adro xung xiaq’.<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />Ji varơuq xalih vlôh hnoq e ka aduq đơu apok heq jah padoh ka oot, đaneq: ‘Khơl êêp be aalq tamooy Gô’,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:26">yôôych jơq aduq nưq, oot hnoq jah taayh laa ‘khơl koot kanau ku Kơy Plêêk hloay riirh.’”<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Bơh Ê-sai pariau tok truh tamooy I-sơ-ra-ên, đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:27">“Long sôôq koot xau ku tamooy I-sơ-ra-ên hnoq ik laa đaji choah tahli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:27">bơh vơ muuyq phon măn soot hlê hnoq jah wơơt,<verse eid="ROM 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />Vii Lôôk hnoq dưk dơơp apok Kadraq tol vari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:28">payôôch ji dayh talăng.”<verse eid="ROM 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />Ji đaji Ê-sai heq đnooy adroyq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:29">“Atoh Lôôk ku kaluh đaauq kuun heq leh xôq hlê ka haay muuyq adrơơk,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:29">yôôych heq đol haay heq biq vlôh jêêk đaji theng Sô-đôm,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:29">ji kajưk laa heq biq dơơp ăm dang đaji theng Gô-mô-rơ.”<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Anưq, haay hnoq đnooy đaleq? Nưq laa khơl tamooy daak kadrơy, 'ngưq laa khơl adro leh hooy tyauq varơuq hyioh jăk, yôôych heq jah ik varơuq hyioh jăk, bơh varơuq hyioh jăk nưq bơyh xuum tuôq. <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />Măn manih I-sơ-ra-ên, tuôôy hooy tyauq ganuun ku varơuq hyioh jăk, yôôych heq leh varơyh truh ganuun nưq. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Vii kakơq kajoq? Nưq laa vii leh bơyh xuum tuôq, bơh đaji bơyh varơuq dơơp. Oot heq xatôôlh jôôk muut kuk phơu ku varơuq klơl hlê, <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />đaji heq jah valơk:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">“Dayh 'yo nee, Gô xôq aduq Si-ôn muuyq kuk phơu ku varơuq klơl hlê ji kuk phơu ku varơuq xatôôlh lôp,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">dro leq tuôq aduq phơu nưq hnoq leh biq kamưưl.”<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Wơơy oh ay, xuum ưng trôôch đom xuum gô ji apok apôôy vôôch ku gô dii Kơy Plêêk thay ka oot laa xôq oot e varơuq wơơt xok. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Bơyh gô dơơp xanưk truh oot đaneq oot e xuum talăng jăk đôôyq dii Kơy Plêêk, bơh leh tyauq varơuq hlolh xet troq jơq. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Jo be nhonq xet varơuq hyioh jăk ku Kơy Plêêk, ji raanq paraat xôq dơơp vlôh varơuq hyioh jăk ku đêh oot, lunưq oot heq leh chiuq tameng 'laarq varơuq hyioh jăk ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Vii Lôôk Wơơt Dêh laa varơuq dơơp payôôch iq đinq ku ganuun xôq jarooy truh varơuq hyioh jăk ka tôôy dro e xuum tuôq. <verse eid="ROM 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Bơyh Môi-se valơk truh varơuq hyioh jăk vlôh xing ganuun, đaneq: “Adro leq heq dơơp tyauq kaluh varơuq neq, yôôych adro nưq gamưh đnư hnoq riirh.” <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Bơh varơuq hyioh jăk bơyh xuum tuôq đnooy luneq: “Te đnooy đom xuum xăk đaneq: ‘Kơyq hnoq tok truh plêêk?’ (iq laa, xôq taway Lôôk Wơơt Dêh pôôt); <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />Long: ‘Kơyq hnoq pôôt truh bơk jaruq?’” (iq laa, xôq taway Lôôk Wơơt Dêh tok xing aduq kaxêêt.) <verse eid="ROM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Wih hlê, varơuq nưq đnooy luleq? “Apok măn jeq koot, đom huuy koot ji đom xuum koot.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 10:8">Nưq laa apok xuum tuôq đơu 'wot đnooy avlôh. <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Vii atoh oh ay xưng nhonq Jê-xu laa Lôôk bơơn vel huuy oh ay, ji oh ay tuôq đom xuum oh ay đaneq Kơy Plêêk heq khienq Kadraq riirh hlê xing aduq kaxêêt, oh ay hnoq jah wơơt. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Vii kơyq bơyh xuum tuôq gamưh yôôych jarooy truh varơuq hyioh jăk, măn kơyq bơyh huuy xưng nhonq yôôych jarooy truh varơuq wơơt xok. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Vii Rahlăp Vah đnooy: “tôôy adro tuôq aduq Kadraq hnoq leh biq kamưưl.” <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Bơyh be e varơuq phon aklah katul manih Jo Thaiq ji manih Hi Lap; vii kung muuyq Kơy laa Lôôk ku dêq hloay, karoh ơơn đôôyq dii dêq hloay khơl leq taayh apôôy Kadraq. <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />Vii “tôôy dro, 'ngưq laa paq kê kơyq heq apôôy taayh yal Lôôk, hnoq jah wơơt.” <verse eid="ROM 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Anưq yôôych, bơơn kach leq oot hnoq ik taayh apôôy truh Kơy đơu oot koq tuôq? Yôôch dơơp aleq oot hnoq ik tuôq Kơy đơu oot koq tameng? Đơu dơơp đaleq oot hnoq ik tameng tuôôy leh e manih padoh taboon? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Bơh khơl dro nưq padoh taboon đaleq atoh oot leh jah patăk dăt? Đaji apok heq jah valơk, đaneq: “Pla jôôk ku khơl adro padoh taboon hêêl kaxay tamaq kaxay xet dong leq!”<verse eid="ROM 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Lunư, leh aalq dêq hloay heq tameng tyauq Hêêl Kaxay. Vii Ê-sai tơơl: “Kuh Lôôk, kơyq heq tuôq apok đnooy padoh ku 'wot?” <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Lunưq, xuum tuôq truh xing varơuq tameng, đơu varơuq tameng nưq gamưh hlê apok ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh. <verse eid="ROM 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />Bơh, gô xiin vôôch: “Dang leq laa oot heq leh tameng ik?” Tol dong dik yôôych,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:18">“Xarooy ku khơl adro nưq heq ahna vlôh truh loch vari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:18">ji apok ku oot truh kaluh aduq lôôch dik ku dêh araak.”<verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />Long anưq, gô xiin vôôch: “Dang aleq laa manih I-sơ-ra-ên heq leh nhonq vlôh?” Adroyq dik, Môi-se đnooy:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">“Kadih Gô hnoq dơơp ka êêp 'yarơ jaraq bơyh khơl adro leh aalq laa muuyq tamooy.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">Gô hnoq tache ka êêp tôq jaraq bơơn muuyq tamooy be e varơuq hlolh xet.”<verse eid="ROM 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />Yôôch Ê-sai xok dơơp kalh paraat, ji kơy đnooy:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:20">“Gô heq jah tavơh bơyh khơl adro be axek akhiim Gô,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:20">Gô heq duh kahnoq vlôh ka khơl adro be apôôy vôôch Gô.”<verse eid="ROM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Măn dii manih I-sơ-ra-ên, Kadraq xanoh: “Tuôôt ka hngơy, Gô tơơk ti gô vlôh wih truh muuyq tamooy leh tameng ji tachơơl hlê.”<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />Anưq gô xiin vôôch: Dang leq Kơy Plêêk heq chôôyq ka'lăk tamooy Kadraq? Varơuq nưq leh xalih vlôh ik. Vii kadih xăk gô kung laa muuyq adro I-sơ-ra-ên, xing adrơơk nooy Ap-ra-ham, thuôk adrơơk tamooy Bên-ja-min. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Kơy Plêêk heq leh chôôyq ka'lăk tamooy Kadraq, laa tamooy Kadraq heq xet adroyq. Long oh ay be xet Rahlăp Vah đnooy kajoq truh Ê-li, tuôôy kơy apôôy padoh dii Kơy Plêêk tachơơl hlê tamooy I-sơ-ra-ên? <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />“Kuh Lôôk, oot heq păk kaxêêt khơl hnhư hlit Kadraq, oot heq pahyaak ka'lăk para hơu Kadraq, kung vơ muuyq adro koot măn jah riirh, ji oot đong hooy axek păk kaxêêt koot.” <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Bơh apok tơơl thiêêng liêng xanoh kung kơy laa kajoq? “Gô heq xôq deng ka Gô pơh ravơu khơl kanau, laa khơl adro heq be kul takuul kangưưr Ba-anh.” <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Anưq kung tyauq kach nưq đom tuôôy kawat juneq, ka'leq nưq măn muuyq phon sook hlê tyauq varơuq rơơlh xok ku vanong plêêk. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Bơh atoh bơyh vanong plêêk, yôôych be aalq bơyh varơuq dơơp đnoyq. Atoh leh, vanong plêêk leh măn laa vanong plêêk. <verse eid="ROM 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Anưq laa đaleq? Varơuq đơu manih I-sơ-ra-ên axek akhiim, yôôych manih nưq heq leh varơyh jah ni, đơu adro leq jah rơơlh yôôych varơyh jah, bơh sôôq măn hlê heq biq găk xuum, <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />đaji varơuq heq jah valơk, đaneq: “Kơy Plêêk heq kahniq ka oot danưng kooy vlô khưrq, mot be hloq, tôôr be tameng, ăm truh hloay hngơy neng.” <verse eid="ROM 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />Ji Đa-vik yôôych đnooy:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:9">“Dayh xôq apoop para ku oot vlôh jêêk lươyq, xađook,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:9">kuk phơu xatôôlh jôôk ji varơuq bla dook deng ka oot.<verse eid="ROM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Dayh xôq mot oot biq apul jaluk xôq be hloq,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:10">ji dayh dơơp karok oot kưq gong kadônq hloay.”<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Anưq, gô xiin vôôch: “Dang aleq oot heq xatôôlh gưlh xôq yôôch gưlh riêp?” Varơuq nưq leh xalih vlôh ik. Tađôôy muut đnư, bơyh varơuq gưlh lôp ku oot, varơuq wơơt xok truh dii tamooy kadrơy, xôq dơơp ka oot 'yarơ jaraq. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Panưh kadrơy, atoh varơuq gưlh lôp ku oot jarooy truh varơuq karoh e ku dêh araak, ji varơuq be jay ku oot jarooy truh varơuq karoh e ku khơl tamooy daak kadrơy, yôôych varơuq xaleep ku oot hnoq kang karoh e raah jôh iaq xet dong leq? <verse eid="ROM 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Măn juneq, gô xiin đnooy dii oh ay laa khơl tamooy daak kadrơy. Anưq, kang bơyh vii kadih xăk gô laa khơl jah rơơlh ka khơl tamooy daak kadrơy, gô xok dơơp tađnah tađnaak truh varơuq dơơp ku gô, <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />xôq long bơơn kach leq nưq, gô hnoq ik dơơp ka tamooy tyauq phon xăk ku gô 'yarơ jaraq ji hnoq ik wơơt ik muuyq sôôq dro xing aduq oot. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Vii atoh varơuq chôôyq ka'lăk ku oot jarooy truh varơuq tagu hlê ku dêh araak, yôôych varơuq oot tiip nhonq hnoq đaleq atoh leh aalq laa varơuq riirh vlôh xing aduq kaxêêt? <verse eid="ROM 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Panưh kadrơy, atoh phon bôôt droyq dik laa vah, yôôych dêq đum bôôt nưq kung đanưq. Ji atoh rayah laa vah, yôôych kaluh đook kung anưq. <verse eid="ROM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Bơh atoh muuyq sôôq đook heq biq gôh hlơơp, măn oh ay, tuôôy laa đook ô-liu gôk, heq jah tabôk muut đom aduq oot, ji heq vlôh jêêk khơl adro kung nhonq jor riirh galaay viik xing rayah ku ưk ô-liu nưq, <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />yôôych te pa ưưt xăk galơh iaq kaluh đook kadrơy. Bơh long oh ay pa ưưt akhwoak, yôôych văch đaneq leh aalq kadih xăk oh ay chiuq văch rayah ưk, đơu laa rayah ưk chiuq văch oh ay. <verse eid="ROM 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Anưq yôôych, oh ay hnoq đnooy: “Kaluh đook nưq heq biq gôh ka'lăk, xôq kadih gô hnoq ik jah tabôk muut.” <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Jơq anưq! Oot heq biq gôh ka'lăk bơyh varơuq leh tuôq, măn kadih oh ay yôôych dưk kajưk gamưh xuum tuôq. Te wih truh kaluh iq biit katơơk galơh, đơu dayh yôq varaal! <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Vii atoh Kơy Plêêk heq leh laay ka'lăk kaluh đook tyauq ka chăk tưq nhiên hơq, yôôych Kadraq kung hnoq be laay ka'lăk oh ay. <verse eid="ROM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Anưq, dayh 'yo xet xuum hwêêt ji varơuq ngiim khăk ku Kơy Plêêk: long varơuq ngiim khăk đôôyq dii khơl adro heq xatôôlh gưlh, bơh xuum hwêêt ku Kơy Plêêk deng ka oh ay, atoh oh ay kưq măn đom varơuq xuum hwêêt Kadraq. Bơơn leh, kadih oh ay kung hnoq biq goch ka'lăk. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Măn khơl adro hơq kung anưq, atoh oot leh raxôôt ratuôôt đom varơuq leh tuôq, yôôych oot hnoq ik tabôk muut. Bơyh Kơy Plêêk e da uh xôq tabôk oot muut hlê. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Vii atoh oh ay heq biq dool klơlh muuyq ưk ôôlh tyauq ka chăk laa ưk ô-liu gôk, ji heq jah tabôk đêh dii trôôk tưq nhiên muut ưk ô-liu kaxay, yôôych khơl adro nưq, 'ngưq laa khơl adro tyauq ka chăk tưq nhiên, hnoq kang jah tabôk muut ưk ô-liu ku kadih ni 'ngưng iaq xet dong leq?<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Vii oh ay lơơy, gô leh trôôch oh ay be xet truh varơuq kadook neq, xôq oh ay leh e varơuq khôôt xet tyauq kadih xăk oh ay, bơyh varơuq găk xuum vlôh xing muuyq phon tamooy I-sơ-ra-ên heq xalih vlôh, dong truh tuôôy đu sôôq kaluh manih daak kadrơy anguk muut; <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />ji đanưq, dêq I-sơ-ra-ên hnoq jah wơơt, đaji heq jah valơk đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:26">“Kơy wơơt xok hnoq truh xing Si-ôn;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:26">Kadraq hnoq ka'lăk vlôh kaluh varơuq xơk aak vlôh klơlh Ja-kôp.<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />Ji nưq laa apok tavek xing aduq Gô deng ka oot,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:27">tuôôy Gô hnoq taway ka'lăk kadrôôp maroh ku oot.”<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />'Yo tyauq Hêêl Kaxay, oot laa adro tachơơl vii kơq ka ich ku oh ay, bơh tyauq varơuq rơơlh xok, yôôych oot laa manih jah xung xiaq vii kơq khơl mo kơy ku oot. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Jo kaluh vanong kaxay ji varơuq taayh tawooyh ku Kơy Plêêk laa kaluh varơuq leh ik tađôôy. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Vii pheq đnooy đaji kadih oh ay tuôôy adroyq heq leh tameng Kơy Plêêk, đơu neq heq jah biit angơuq aduq varơuq leh tameng ku khơl adro neq, <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />yôôych kung đanưq, khơl adro neq juneq heq leh tameng aduq varơuq biit angơuq oh ay, xôq juneq oot kung hnoq ik jah biit angơuq. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Vii Kơy Plêêk heq karuk tôôy adro đom varơuq leh tameng, xôq Kadraq hnoq ik kahnoq xuum biit angơuq tôôy dro. <verse eid="ROM 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Ôôy, tolh dik pi jaruq truh varơuq karoh e ji varơuq khôôt kheoq kung varơuq hlolh xet ku Kơy Plêêk! Luleq kaluh xưh xadrah ku Kadraq leh hnoq 'yo xadrah, ji trôôk daak Kadraq leh hlolh xet ik!<verse eid="ROM 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />Vii, “Kơyq heq xet xuum biit ku Lôôk?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:34">Long kơyq heh vlôh jêêk adro đnooy pato ku Kadraq?<verse eid="ROM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />Long kơyq heq ăm Kadraq adroyq,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:35">yôôch hnoq jah Kadraq bla hlê?”<verse eid="ROM 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />Vii tôôy paroh vlôh xing Kadraq, gamưh muut Kadraq, ji wih xuq Kadraq. Tađnah tađnaak thuôk xuq Kadraq dong truh đơơy đơơy. Amen.<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Anưq, wơơy oh ay, bơyh varơuq biit angơuq ku Kơy Plêêk, gô ahmưk nhăk oh ay tơơk tưp ka Kơy Plêêk xăk xamơk oh ay đaji muuyq kuah lêh riirh, vah xarêh, kaxay xuum Kadraq, 'ngưq laa varơuq ayuôôt laat jơq troq ku oh ay. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Ji te chiuq rôp khwuôôn tyauq đơơy neq, bơh dayh jah tađôôy đơơu xing varơuq tađôôy đơơu ku xuum biit, xôq oh ay kahra ik varơuq leq laa iq trôôch tolh tamaq, kaxay xuum, ji xaleep ku Kơy Plêêk.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Vii gamưh vanong plêêk heq jah kahniq ka gô, gô xiin đnooy dii tôôy adro măn katul đom oh ay te liq biit truh xăk galơh iaq varơuq pheq biit, tađôôy muut đnư laa 'yo hlê xôq khôôt xet jư xăk, tyauq đaji Kơy Plêêk heq phon ahlook muuyq nưh tyauq xuum tuôq ka tôôy dro. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />Bơyh pheq đnooy đaji haay e 'ngưng xăk xamơk đom muuyq xăk, bơh dêq hloay kaluh xăk xamơk leh e kung muuyq varơuq dơơp, <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />yôôych tyauq kach dang anưq, 'ngưng dro haay laa muuyq xăk đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, đơu tôôy muuyq adro laa xăk xamơk ku mamuuyq. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Bơh haay e kaluh kadrool vanong kaxay đêh raa 'yo tyauq vanong plêêk heq jah kahniq ka haay: e be laa vanong đnooy hlit, yôôych dưk dơơp 'yo tyauq đaji xuum tuôq; <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />e be laa vanong hơu varơuq, yôôych dưk dơơp đom varơuq hơu varơuq; e be laa vanong pato dayq, yôôych dưk dơơp đom varơuq pato dayq; <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />e be laa vanong ahmưk nhăk, yôôych dưk dơơp đom varơuq ahmưk nhăk; vanong kahniq ăm, yôôych dưk dơơp bơơn varơuq ranưh ranơơy; vanong dưk xanok, yôôych dưk dơơp bơơn varơuq dêq xuum; vanong kahnoq xuum biit angơuq, yôôych dưk dơơp bơơn varơuq hlah hlaak.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Xung xiaq yôôych leh dơơp bôô, vii 'yo ramêq varơuq xơk, jư xăk tagu dii varơuq kaxay; <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />ji varơuq xung xiaq deng ka mamuuyq đom xuum xung xiaq oh ay; dơơp ramil ka mamuuyq đom varơuq 'yo vado; <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />laa leh takôô alah đom varơuq talăng jăk; tôq jaq đom xuum klaak; hơu varơuq Lôôk; <verse eid="ROM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />hlah hlaak đom takôô gamưh; atuq xuum đom pơơl dal; kajưk xuum đom varơuq xadrook apôôy; <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />waak tajưp kaluh varơuq duh ku khơl vah; tavooy tyauq xuum xung tamooy. <verse eid="ROM 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Dayh apôôy vanong ka khơl adro rôp toop oh ay; dayh apôôy vanong ji te karoay axaap; <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />xôq hlah kung dii khơl adro hlah; xôq nhim kung dii khơl adro nhim; <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />tuôôy e kung muuyq xuum biit deng ka mamuuyq, leh e xuum biit katơơk galơh, bơh laa chiuq 'yo nhonq khơl adro axit xet. Te vlôh jêêk khôôt kheoq ganưq tol kadih haay; <verse eid="ROM 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />tuôôy leh bla hlê varơuq xơk bơơn varơuq xơk ka paq kê kơyq, tabông 'yo kaluh varơuq kaxay tamaq kangưưr tôôy dro; <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />atoh hnoq ik, ka aduq leq thuôk xuq haay, yôôych jư 'yo varơuq tagu dii tôôy dro; <verse eid="ROM 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />oh ay xung xiaq lơơy, te kadih haay bla thu, bơh dayh xôq aduq ka đơơt tôq jaraq ku Kơy Plêêk, vii varơuq heq jah valơk: “‘Varơuq bla thu deng ka Gô; Gô hnoq bla dook,’ Lôôk đnooy anưq.”<verse eid="ROM 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />“Lunư, atoh adro tachơơl oh ay e pangoot, dayh ăm ni xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 12:20">Atoh dro nưq thaal, dayh ăm ni hôôch.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 12:20">Vii tuôôy dơơp anưq, oh ay hnoq đum kheng ôôlh dôôp tol akoq ni.”<verse eid="ROM 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Te xôq haay biq tameng tyauq xing varơuq xơuq, bơh dayh jah jay varơuq xơuq bơơn varơuq kaxay.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Tôôy adro muuyq pheq tameng tyauq khơl dro e kaluh qwuyen măn tol haay, vii be kaluh qwuyen leq măn hlê atoh leh bơyh Kơy Plêêk, măn kaluh qwuyen đong e yôôych jah 'yo đinq xing Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Lunưq, kơyq xôq xăk tachơơl hlê kaluh qwuyen nưq laa tachơơl hlê apok tanưưl ku Kơy Plêêk, đơu khơl adro tachơơl hlê nưq hnoq kadih varơyh xok varơuq xadrah dook ka ni. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Vii khơl hnhư adrơk qwuyen leh aalq laa varơuq yôq varaal đôôyq dii varơuq kaxay, bơh laa ka varơuq xơuq. Măn oh ay trôôch klơlh pheq yôq khơl adrơk qwuyen nưq be? Dayh dơơp varơuq kaxay, yôôych oh ay hnoq nhonq varơuq vado xing dro adrơk qwuyen, <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />Bơyh vii dro nưq laa xapok ku Kơy Plêêk wih truh varơuq kaxay tamaq ka oh ay. Bơh atoh oh ay dơơp varơuq xơk, yôôych dayh yôq varaal, vii oot be adrơk xieh muuyq kach leh e kơq, bơyh oot laa xapok ku Kơy Plêêk, 'ngưq laa manih bla thu xôq đơơt tôq jaraq deng ka adro dưk dơơp varơuq xơuq. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Kơq nưq, varơuq duh dik laa chiuq tameng tyauq, leh vơ vii đơơt tôq dayh, đơu măn vii kơq xuum klaak. <verse eid="ROM 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Bơyh kung vii varơuq nưq lunưq oh ay noop xơu; kơq oot laa xapok ku Kơy Plêêk, raanq paraat ratuut hloay đôôyq dii ka varơuq dơơp neq. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Dayh bla ka tôôy adro varơuq haay e lôôkq oot; xơu ka adro xok xơu; phiq ka adro xok phiq; yôq adro đangq pheq yôq; vado adro đangq pheq vado.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Te elôôkq kơyq paq kê varơuq kajoq, đêh vlôh xung xiaq ka mamuuyq, vii kơyq xiaq manih gah gih yôôych dơơp xaleep ganuun. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Vii varơuq neq: “Koot te lôp kadrôôp apuq atrăp, koot te păk kaxêêt manih, koot te atôk, koot te hmưch trôôch,” ji atoh măn paq kê apok tanưưl leq kadrơy, yôôych tôôy varơuq nưq jah ruut hlê đom apok neq: “Koot pheq xiaq manih gah gih ku koot đaji kadih koot.” <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Xuum xung xiaq leh dơơp haiq manih gah gih. Anưq, xung xiaq laa varơuq dơơp xaleep ganuun.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Ji lu nưq, vii xet katuôôy kawat, đaneq heq truh tuôôy ka oh ay pheq kadrăch kah xing vik tawol. Bơyh juneq varơuq wơơt xok ku haay heq jeq iaq taso dii tuôôy haay đơơu tuôq. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Klôôy heq katul mưng, măn hngơy jeq truh. Anưq, haay duh qwel ka'lăk kaluh varơuq dơơp ku varơuq kamơng jaluk, yôôch hlưp xok aau jaap ku varơuq tađnah. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />Haay duh tawaak hooy kach xưngq dik đaji katul kahngơy, leh xa hôôch ji vuul weel, leh apuq atrăp ji bơyq ba, leh tayaat takaay ji geen 'yarơ. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Wiit hlê, dayh hlưp xok Lôôk, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, ji te dưk dơơp tyauq xôq vih adroyq ku xăk xamơk wih truh kaluh hmưch trôôch.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />Panưh kadrơy, dayh đoonq nhonq adro ravoch đom xuum tuôq, leh wih truh varơuq atok xadrah kaluh varơuq koq xet hlolh. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Long muuyq kơyq nưq e xuum tuôq xôq xa tôôy thư, bơh adro ravoch yôôych vơ xa kaxeq qwaay. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Adro xa te 'yo leh ra kajoq adro leh xa, măn adro leh xa te xưh xadrah adro xa. Vii Kơy Plêêk heq đoonq nhonq dro nưq. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />Adro xưh xadrah xapok đom hnhư ku adro kadrơy, ay laa kơyq? Adro nưq dưk long gưlh laa đôôyq dii kôôch ku kadih dro nưq. Bơh adro nưq hnoq jah khienq ăm dưk kajưk, vii Lôôk e da uh qwuyen khienq ay nưq dưk kajưk. <verse eid="ROM 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Long dro neq phon đinq hngơy hơq dii hngơy kadrơy, bơh dro kadrơy yôôych biit tôôy hngơy laa tolh kaxay. Tôôy dro dayh tuôq kajưk đom akoq haay. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Adro jư hngơy laa jư vii Lôôk, adro xa laa xa vii Lôôk, vii dro nưq kuh kway Kơy Plêêk, adro leh xa laa leh xa vii Lôôk, dro nưq kung kuh kway Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Kơq leh ekơyq đom haay riirh vii kadih haay, ji leh ekơyq kaxêêt vii kadih haay. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />Bơyh kaah tuôôy haay riirh, laa riirh vii Lôôk, hloay tuôôy haay kaxêêt, laa kaxêêt vii Lôôk. Anưq, kaah tuôôy haay riirh hloay tuôôy haay kaxêêt, yôôych haay raay thuôk xuq Lôôk. <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Vii xôq jarooy truh varơuq neq, Lôôk Wơơt Dêh heq kaxêêt ji heq laay riirh, xôq Kadraq dơơp Lôôk vơơ ku adro kaxêêt, vơơ ku adro riirh. <verse eid="ROM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />Bơh ay neq, aleq ay xưh xadrah oh ay haay? Long ay hơq, aleq ay 'yo leh ra kajoq oh ay haay? Vii dêq hloay haay hnoq avlôh xăk kangưưr ngôôy xưh xadrah ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />Bơyh apok heq jah valơk:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">“Lôôk xanoh đaneq: ‘Đaji Gô hloay riirh, tôôy takuul hnoq kul kangưưr Gô,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">ji tôôy kapiet hnoq xưng nhonq kangưưr Kơy Plêêk.’”<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Lunưq, tôôy dro đom haay hnoq tauq vlôh apok đnooy vlôh truh kadih xăk dii Kơy Plêêk.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Jo nưq, haay te liq đnooy xadrah mamuuyq đnoyq, wih hlê, dayh 'yo đinq luneq yơu iaq; leh xôq kuk phơu klơl đơ long kakơq xatôôlh gưlh ka oh ay haay. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Gô xet ji jah tuôq kajưk đom Lôôk Jê-xu, đaneq be vâk kajoq bơyh kadih xăk ni laa klơơr 'yêq, đêh vlôh adro leq 'yo hlê thư kajoq nưq laa klơơr 'yêq, yôôych ni laa klơơr 'yêq đôôyq dii dro nưq. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Bơyh atoh adro oh ay haay biq dơơp ăm jiq xuum vii kơq tuôông xa, yôôych oh ay leh măn tawaak hooy tyauq xuum xung xiaq đnoyq. Te bơyh tuôông xa ku haay dơơp hư hlơơp adro oh ay nưq, 'ngưq laa dro đơu Lôôk Wơơt Dêh heq kaxêêt thay. <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Anưq, te xôq varơuq kaxay tamaq ku oh ay biq đnooy ra ơơh. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Vii daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk leh aalq măn tuôông xa ji tuôông hôôch, bơh laa varơuq hyioh jăk ji hrok hrol kung varơuq hlah hlaak đom Lôôk Phool Hiel. <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Vii kơyq hơu varơuq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh bơơn kach neq yôôych kaxay xuum Kơy Plêêk ji jah 'yo nhonq bơyh koot manih. <verse eid="ROM 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Lunưq, haay duh charơơk tyauq kaluh varơuq tagu hlê ji kaluh varơuq waak tajưp deng ka mamuuyq. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />Te phaq pahrưp varơuq dơơp ku Kơy Plêêk vii dong varơuq tuôông xa. Tabơh tôôy vâk laa vah xarêh, bơh laa kadrôôp maroh đôôyq dii adro xa tyauq kach dơơp kơq xatôôlh lôp. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Varơuq tolh kaxay laa leh xa ôq kung leh hôôch lok long paq kê varơuq kajoq đơu hlê đnư khienq adro oh ay ku haay xatôôlh gưlh, long biq gưlh lôp, long laa vlôh jêêk ravoch. <verse eid="ROM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Kadih xăk oh ay e xuum tuôq luleq, dayh jư xok 'yo muut kadih xăk kangưưr Kơy Plêêk. Vanong hloay laa adro leh kadih atok xadrah xăk đom varơuq xăk 'yo xanưk laa jơq. <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Bơh muuyq dro heq biq đinq kadrôôp atoh dro nưq heq xa đong tuôôy biit ravơq, vii leh vlôh xing xuum tuôq. Panưh kadrơy, tôôy varơuq đơu leh vlôh xing xuum tuôq yôôych laa kadrôôp.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Bơh haay, laa manih kalh paraat, pheq gengq hlôôy kaluh ravoch ku adro leh kalh, ji be dơơp nhăp xuum haay. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Tôôy adro đom haay dayh dơơp nhăp xuum manih gah gih haay vii ka iq tamaq kaxay, wih truh varơuq rôôk tơơk dro nưq. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />Vii hloay kaah Lôôk Wơơt Dêh heq leh dơơp nhăp xuum kadih xăk. Wih hlê, đaji varơuq heq jah valơk: “Kaluh apok đnooy ra ơơh ku khơl adro đnooy ra ơơh Kadraq heq uk hlê tol koot.” <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Bơyh xet taleq 'ngưng varơuq heq jah valơk pôôt adroyq neq yôôych heq jah valơk hlê vii varơuq pato dayq ka kadih haay, xôq ka gamưh varơuq atuq xuum ji gamưh varơuq ahmưk nhăk ku Rahlăp Vah, haay e jah xuum takôô gamưh. <verse eid="ROM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Apôôy xiin Kơy Plêêk ku varơuq atuq xuum ji hmơk nhăk kahniq vanong ka oh ay xôq e kung muuyq xuum biit dii mamuuyq tyauq đaji Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />xôq ka oh ay hnoq ik kung muuyq xuum, bơyh muuyq huuy ayuôôt laat Kơy Plêêk, laa Vaq ku Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Anưq, dayh tiip nhonq mamuuyq, kung đaji Lôôk Wơơt Dêh heq tiip nhonq oh ay, xôq wih truh varơuq tađnah tađnaak ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Vii gô xiin đnooy đaneq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh heq jah khienq vlôh jêêk xapok ku manih chiuq goch kađuh vii kơq varơuq dik ku Kơy Plêêk, xôq 'yo nhonq apok tavek ku khơl mo kơy, <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />bơh laa xôq khơl tamooy kadrơy ayuôôt laat Kơy Plêêk vii kơq xuum biit angơuq ku Kadraq, dang đaji apok heq jah valơk:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:9">“Bơyh nưq, koot hnoq xưng nhonq Kadraq katul khơl tamooy daak kadrơy</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:9">ji kacheeu ayuôôt yal Kadraq.”<verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />Laay e valơk đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:10">“Khơl tamooy daak kadrơy, dayh hlah hlaak kung dii tamooy Kadraq.”<verse eid="ROM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />Ji laay đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:11">“Dêq hloay khơl tamooy daak kadrơy, dayh ayuôôt laat Lôôk;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:11">dêq hloay kaluh tamooy, dayh kacheeu ayuôôt Kadraq.”<verse eid="ROM 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Ji Ê-sai đnooy athêêp đnoyq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">“Rayah ku Je-sê hnoq rama vlôh, laa Kơy jah panưk tok xôq dưk xanok khơl tamooy daak kadrơy;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">kaluh tamooy daak kadrơy hnoq e xuum takôô gamưh aduq Kadraq.”<verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Apôôy Kơy Plêêk ku xuum takôô gamưh khienq oh ay galơh galaay tôôy varơuq hlah hlaak ji hrok hrol đom xuum tuôq, xôq dơơp ka oh ay raah jôh đom xuum takôô gamưh gamưh da uh ku Lôôk Phool Hiel.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Panưh kadrơy, wơơy oh ay ku gô, kadih xăk gô kung jah tameng tyauq truh oh ay đaneq kadih oh ay kung jah galơh galaay varơuq tolh kaxay, vii heq jah galôp viik tôôy hok xet ji e ka paraat xôq ahmưk nhăk mamuuyq. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Bơh gô heq valơk kach kalh paraat ka oh ay 'ngưng iaq đom aduq neq aduq hơq đaji xôq hmơk nhăk oh ay, bơyh vanong plêêk heq jah Kơy Plêêk kahniq ka gô, <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />xôq khienq gô laa muuyq xapok ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu ka khơl tamooy daak kadrơy, tuôôy dưk dơơp varơuq tơơk tưp ka Hêêl Kaxay ku Kơy Plêêk, xôq ka kuah lêh ku khơl tamooy daak kadrơy hnoq ik jah hlah xuum đoonq nhonq, xing tuôôy jah paxa rêh bơyh Kơy Phool Hiel. <verse eid="ROM 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Kơq nưq, đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, gô e varơuq pa ưưt xăk đôôyq dii kaluh varơuq dơơp thuôk xuq Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Vii gô hnoq be hôôk đnooy paq kê varơuq kajoq đơu varơuq nưq leh aalq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh heq dưk dơơp hlê gô, xôq jarooy truh varơuq tameng tyauq ku khơl tamooy daak kadrơy — bơyh apok đnooy hloay varơuq dơơp, <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />bơơn paraat kalh ku kaluh hlêêl akêh ji pheep akêh, bơơn da uh Kơy Phool Hiel ku Kơy Plêêk — pheq đnooy gô heq padoh taboon Hêêl Kaxay ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh kach đu tol xing Jê-ru-sa-lem ji rawiit dêq dong truh hloay I-li-ri; <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />đơu tyauq kach nưq, kưq raanq đnoyq dii hmưch trôôch padoh taboon Hêêl Kaxay be aalq ka aduq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh heq jah taayh apôôy, xôq ka gô be xơy panưk gamưh tol kahnier ku adro kadrơy. <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />Lunư, dang đaji varơuq heq jah valơk:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:21">“Khơl adro koq jah padoh taboon truh Kadraq yôôych hnoq hloq,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:21">ji khơl adro koq hmưq tameng yôôych hnoq hlolh.”<verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Anưq, 'ngưng yưk gô kung heq biq klơl hlê xôq truh dii oh ay. <verse eid="ROM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Bơh juneq, vii leh măn e aduq đom kaluh dêh neq, đơu vii văch xôq xuum trôôch kajoq truh hlơq oh ay xing 'ngưng xanưm, <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />lunưq long tuôôy leq gô dưk hooy truh Tay-ban-nha, gô dik trôôch kajoq, tuôôy hooy dalơh hlê, tavơh oh ay, ji jah oh ay waak rơy truh đnư, atoh droyq dik gô jah hlah xuum dii oh ay đom axit kawah. <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Măn juneq gô đong hooy tol trôôk truh Jê-ru-sa-lem waak ka khơl vah. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Vii manih Ma-xê-đoan ji A-chai heq hlah xuum dưk dơơp muuyq đơơt tagoop agoop nưq ka khơl adro adrah pangoot katul đom khơl vah aduq theng Jê-ru-sa-lem. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />Bơyh oot heq hlah xuum ji oot laa khơl adro pơq lôôkq khơl adro nưq. Vii atoh kaluh tamooy daak kadrơy jah kung nhonq kaluh vanong danưng kooy ku khơl adro nưq, yôôych oot kung e trek nhiimq hơu varơuq khơl adro nưq truh panưh kông kuah. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Anưq, tuôôy heq payôôch varơuq neq ji hôôk kajưk kadrool tagoop agoop neq truh dii oot, yôôych gô hnoq dưk hooy dalơh hlê oh ay xôq truh Tay-ban-nha. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />Đơu gô xet đaneq tuôôy truh dii oh ay, gô hnoq truh dii varơuq đu tol vanong ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh.<verse eid="ROM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Panưh kadrơy, wơơy oh ay, bơyh Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, ji bơyh xuum xung xiaq ku Kơy Phool Hiel, gô apôôy xiin oh ay kung damưq dii gô bơơn kaluh apok xadrook apôôy thaay ka gô wih tok Kơy Plêêk, <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />xôq gô hnoq ik jah wơơt xok klơlh khơl adro leh tameng tyauq aduq Ju-đê, ji xôq varơuq dơơp ku gô deng ka Jê-ru-sa-lem hnoq ik jah hlah xuum đoonq nhonq xing khơl vah; <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />xôq ka bơyh iq trôôch ku Kơy Plêêk, gô hnoq ik truh dii oh ay đom varơuq hlah hlaak, vii jah padơy pado kung dii oh ay. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Apôôy xiin Kơy Plêêk hrok hrol măn kung dêq hloay oh ay. Amen.<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Đêh vlôh, gô atăq xôq dii oh ay mư Phê-bê, dro oh ay ku 'wot, kung laa adro hơu varơuq ku Tayuup Vah aduq Xen-kơ-rê, <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />xôq oh ay hnoq ik tiip đoonq mư đom Lôôk, tyauq kach xưngq dik dii khơl vah, ji truh waak tajưp mư đom dong varơuq leq đơu mư duh truh oh ay. Vii mư kung heq vlôh jêêk adro waak tajưp ka 'ngưng dro, jauq hloay kadih xăk gô.<verse eid="ROM 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />Vôôch hrok Bê-rit-sin ji A-qui-la, khơl 'wơyq achung varơuq ku gô đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />nưq laa khơl adro heq hôôk kaxêêt xăk riirh vii kơq xăk riirh ku gô, leh vơ kadih gô kaam ơơn oot, đơu dêq hloay kaluh tayuup vah ku khơl tamooy daak kadrơy đnoyq, <verse eid="ROM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />ji vôôch hrok tayuup vah aduq hnhư oot. Vôôch hrok Ê-bai-nêt, oh ay xung xiaq ku gô, đơu ay nưq laa play droyq dik ku dêh A-si ka Lôôk Wơơt Dêh. <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Vôôch hrok Ma-ri, adro heq dơơp varơuq thier pơơl hwơơl vii oh ay. <verse eid="ROM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Vôôch hrok An-trô-ni-kơ ji Ju-ni-a, adro takuul takiel ku gô, ji 'wơyq achung karuk ku gô, vaarq dro nưq laa khơl dro jah vado katul đom khơl jah rơơlh, đơu oot kung heq măn đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh adroyq gô. <verse eid="ROM 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Vôôch hrok Am-li-a, 'wơyq xung xiaq ku gô đom Lôôk. <verse eid="ROM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Vôôch hrok U-rơ-banh, 'wơyq achung varơuq ku 'wot đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, ji Êch-ta-chi, 'wơyq xung xiaq ku gô. <verse eid="ROM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Vôôch hrok A-be-lơ, adro jah tiip nhonq đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh. Vôôch hrok khơl manih đom kôôch hnhư ku A-rich-tô-bu. <verse eid="ROM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Vôôch hrok Hê-rô-đi-ôn, adro takuul takiel ku gô. Vôôch hrok dro leq thuôk kôôch hnhư ku Nat-xit, laa khơl adro măn đom Lôôk. <verse eid="ROM 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Vôôch hrok Tri-phe-nơ ji Tri-phô-sơ, khơl adro pơơl hwơơl đom Lôôk. Vôôch hrok Bet-xi-đơ xung xiaq, adro heq dơơp varơuq thier galeh galal đom Lôôk. <verse eid="ROM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />Vôôch hrok Ru-phu, adro jah rơơlh đom Lôôk, kung miq ku ay nưq ji ku gô. <verse eid="ROM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Vôôch hrok A-sin-kơ-rich, Phơ-lê-gôn, Het-me, Ba-trô-ba, Het-ma, ji khơl oh ay măn dii oot. <verse eid="ROM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Vôôch hrok Phi-lô-lô-gơ ji Ju-li, Nê-rê ji ay kadrê ay nưq, kung Ô-lim ji dêq hloay khơl vah măn dii oot. <verse eid="ROM 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Dayh kahnoq xuum 'yo vado mamuuyq bơơn kabiin hiip vah. Dêq hloay kaluh tayuup vah ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh vôôch hlơq oh ay.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Panưh kadrơy, wơơy oh ay, gô ahmưk nhăk oh ay rơơt rol dii khơl adro dơơp vlôh varơuq aklah vlôh ji kơq gưlh lôp, đêh dii pato dayh đơu oh ay heq hok, ji dayh chuh xangưưy klơlh oot. <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />Vii khơl adro đanưq leh hơu varơuq Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, bơh laa poop klaak ku kadih oot, ji bơyh apok langưưp xuum kung adô pa ôôh, oot aluut pa ôôh padêq khơl xuum klaak klêq hlơu. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Bơyh xuum tameng tyauq ku oh ay heq pahêêr vlôh truh tôôy dro. Kơq nưq, gô hlah hlaak truh oh ay, bơh gô trôôch oh ay jah khôôt xet truh varơuq kaxay, đơu xarêh xaraat đôôyq dii varơuq xơk. <verse eid="ROM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Kơy Plêêk ku varơuq hrok hrol hnoq joaq raniaq Sa-tan 'laarq jôôk oh ay kach talăng dayh.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 16:20">Apôôy vanong plêêk ku Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, măn dii oh ay.<verse eid="ROM 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Ti-mô-thê, 'wơyq achung varơuq ku gô, kung Lu-si-ut, Gia-sôn, ji Sô-xi-ba-tê, khơl adro takuul takiel ku gô, atăq apok hlơq oh ay. <verse eid="ROM 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Gô, Tet-tiu, adro valơk hla thư neq, atăq apok vôôch hlơq oh ay đom Lôôk. <verse eid="ROM 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />Gai-ut, adro tiip đoonq gô ji hloay tayuup vah, atăq apok vôôch hlơq oh ay. Ê-ra-tu, adro jư jêêt ku theng phôq, kung dii dro oh ay Qua-tu, atăq apok vôôch hlơq oh ay. <verse eid="ROM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />[Apôôy vanong plêêk ku Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, măn kung dêq hloay oh ay. Amen.]<verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />Apôôy tađnah tađnaak thuôk xuq Kơy hnoq ik khienq oh ay kajưk kalh tyauq Hêêl Kaxay ku gô ji varơuq padoh taboon Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, tyauq varơuq kahnoq vlôh truh varơuq kadook hmưq jah jư padu đom tuôôt kawat yơơt dalơh hlê 'ngưng đơơy xanưm, <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />Bơh neq heq jah kahnoq vlôh, kung tuôôy bơyh kaluh rahlăp hlit, tyauq tanưưl ku Kơy Plêêk đơơy đơơy, heq jah đnooy vlôh ka tôôy tamooy xôq wih truh varơuq tameng tyauq ku xuum tuôq, <verse eid="ROM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />apôôy tađnah tađnaak thuôk xuq Kadraq, laa Kơy Plêêk khôôt xet muuyq heq, gamưh Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, dong truh đơơy đơơy. Amen.<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>